<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">U gabatarwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Aco dinya a i kokari a rubuci ina pale na tsakani gaci. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />A rubuci ina ga̠ci huge daga unu we aco na a hyan ini ka̠mu na haisa haba tun na jigu, hinda a zwame cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek </char><char style="fq" closed="false">From those who from the beginning were servants of the word.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Zwama haruni, buco bu labe Tiyopilus, Nga̠ gya na bicika ina ka̠mu na lapta wui suwa, tun daga jigu waba, na hyan u gyamaci gya bu rubuci uni uika, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Zwama goo i daki ina ka̠mu na kamahinda nga̠ abu cibaga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 1:4">Cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci burya̠ cina ci Luka uba rubuci</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:4">Na bu bungago, O Tiyofilos: 1 Aco dinyiya a i kokari pan labari ina ia̠gi na ga̠ci, <verse eid="LUK 1:4" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />kyabo nga̠ aba ci cutan pa aco ana hyanagi na haisa hab hinda na gyama cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Zwama haruni, nga̠ gya Tiyofilus, na icwa nimoi na byagano tibai na jigo, ubeh usan gya na hyan ugyamace again gya na rubucigya hyan icubaga tibai ni tibai, bulabe Teophilus <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />zwama go boi daki kamahinda ina aba bucibage.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ZWAMAGE MACO U YOHANA U BAPTISMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Na lokaci una Hiridus asa bugwama bu Yahudiya azase Bulabe buna aba ogo Zakariya, buna bu yiwa na kungiya u Labe yaba Abiya; bu'a bu bware Alisabatu busa bwa azwag a Haruna. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ka̠mu waba asa aco burya̠ na lagan cikarigo ci Hwinsu, na ina uba hyan ana a ia̠g na buza magwata̠. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Hinda ka̠mu wab aza saawo, zwama Alisabatu Hwinsu u gunda umacishon oba; hinda a ongago.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Aza hona uringu uba wa ringi pa zakariya na acagiye labe a ise iginga a iyi ibwana i bugyama pa Hwinsu, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />ama byane kwa aba na cibukana bware, ina alabe aba ia̠gu bini, a ese na iginga zwama icikanu i turare ula. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Nga̠ lokaci uba i una aba cigano tulare ula, aco na a kurya ka̠mu ia̠go ahunda̠ amatanaga na ijapu.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Kwa acuma Hwinsu na silta bware, kwa na yisan wa ucuga amam na ciyabu ci ihug ina i bware buba ka̠ri cubi tulare ula. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Nga̠ Zakariya aba hyan acuma , kwa iwas na ikobe bware dinyiya hal bu rudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Hinda kwa acuma Hwinsu na hin na bware: &lt;&lt;Ta huga iwasa Zakariya; Hwinsu u hog ahunda̱ na bui. Bu'a bube Alisabatu bui bu mace bwa, goo zane bwa iziya Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Bui san goo huge laco dinyiya, hinda aco dinyiya ai hoge laco zwama maco uboba, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />zwama bui sana bulabe dinya pa ibwana i Hwinshu. Bu za isho maro ko ina nyaga na maro, hinda anhuru a Hwinshu ai yana na bware kapi maco u bware. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Yohana i ringe aco Isra'ila dinya pa Hwinshu waba. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Yohana i san koro pa Bugwama bu doone, na anhuru na kuce u Iliya, zwama bu ringiya shuwa hacaca pa maka̠la̠ ma saawo hinda aco na aza nagu hacobe a marigiya aco burya̠ na harbuni buba bwe kimgaga Hwinsu aco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Kwa Zakariya na kaban acuma a Hwinsu, &lt;&lt;Niya gya na daki an ina go buna zwama iyiwa harbuni? gya na ongwa bu'a bumoi hinda haya ha buba hinda ha mosho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Acuma a Hwinsu kwa ni cane, &lt;&lt;Gyamoi Jibra'ilu. Buna busa bu yinsa ciyabu na Hwinshu, hinda ana cuma ahwaboi gya bu zwama cikarigo ci laco. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Hinda bu za ipwanakana cikarigo kwa hona ina gya na zwamage i sinji, zwama go bwe yajuwa na cikarigo acimu, cina ci korya hona u kamace.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Baniyo, aco kwa anpa zakariya hinda a ma kabo bai san bware buba sani na shuwa oi iginga. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Inga bware buba bwa sirya, buma yage cikarigo. Kwa aba nai ganige an bware ruya na iginga, zwama bu hina eago cikarigo na wa hinda bu mayage na cikarigo.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Inga hon ui bwana ibware iba hogi kwa bware na maringya giwo. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Nga̠ mohon muba ia̠ bu'a bu Alisabatu kwa na sigi mukaba̠ kwa iba na maswo hal pyana ita. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Alzabatu na hin, Hwinsu una ia̠gi gya haruna,&gt;&gt; i hin. &lt;&lt;Na mohon muna u hoge yama nimui hinda u zangi muyan pa aco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">A cube Maco u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Na pyana u cunuhin, Hwinsu u cuma acuma Jibra'ilu korwa i'ogo i Nazaret, pa i'ogo ina i yiwa na Galili, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />pa ikangaza ina i dakuwo buco bu cware ina eaba zabi buciyahya iziya i buba Isufu, bwa azwaga a Dauda. Iziya ikangaza ini Imaryamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Kwa acuma Hwinsu na kore pa iba kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Sanu, go buna bo Hwinsu uba hoge yama dinyiya! Hwinsu u yiwa na goo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Imaryamu i madame na soo dinyiya kwa iba hyen na soo u iba iri wanba usanu haruni. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Kwa acuma Hwinsu na hin na Imaryamu, &lt;&lt;Ta huga iwasa, Imaryamu, bu hinwo yama i Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Bui sigimukab mace bwa bu cware, hinda goo zane bo iziya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Bui san buco bu labe hinda ai ogan bwa, Bwa buna bu Buca̠ bu yaba uba kari. Hwinsu Buca̠ bu yaba ui pan bwa cigwama ci hacaca ha buba Dauda uba sa, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />hinda bui ea cigwama ci yaba Yakub hal doone u hogi cigwama ci buba ciza izana uhare.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />&lt;&lt;Neya ini iba i ia̠go,&gt;&gt; Imaryamu i kabo acuma, &lt;&lt;Gyamui abuna na dakuwo buco bu cware?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Kwa acuma na cane, &lt;&lt;Ahuru a Hwinshu ai korya ahwabui, hinda koce i Buco Buna ui bu kubtan. Hinda buna bo goo bui mace bu nagu magwata̠ ai zana bo iziya Bwa bu nagu ciri bu Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Hinda Alisabatu ana a ga̠hi isa azwaga aikan naba ai mace bwa na ci'onga caba, ina aba hin ana iza matakana iza mukaba̠ pyana u cunihi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kwa Bucuma bu Hwinsu bu hin aza ina Hwinsu uba pwanuwa ia̠ga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />&lt;&lt;Gya na sa bugyama bu Hwinsu,&gt;&gt; Imaryamu i cane. &lt;&lt;Ina goo bu hin na gya a i harbuni.&gt;&gt; Kwa acuma Hwinsu na curya ean. Imaryamu i kore pa Alisabatu<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imaryamu i kure bunga Alzabatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Aza hona Imaryamu ema mahaguza kwa na kore i'ogo ina iyiwa zata u i'ogo na cinge ci Yahudiya, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />I ese yaba i Zakariya kwa na sana Alisabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Inga Alisabatu aba hoge u sanu u Imaryamu, kwa bwa bu mukaba̠ mu iba na mazarika, kwa a̠huru a Hwinsu na sinji Alisabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Kwa Alisabatu na san cu ogo: &lt;&lt;Pa sia kamu buza uno u burya̠, hinda bwa buna bu yiwa na mukaba̠ amabui buza uno u burya̠! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Bai san gya ni hin maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu, ina isan amci a bugwama bu doonee aba a kore pa homui? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nga̠ gya na hog usanu nibui uba na es hacube ahwamui, bwa bu mukaba̠ amamui kwa na mazarika na wawo. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Uno u burya̠ ui bulagana goo buna bu yaje ana ina Hwinsu uba zwama nya̠ ui san kamahinda!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hazuga ha Imaryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Hinda Imaryamu i hin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;Soo nimui uyiwa na pan Bugwama Hwinsu cilabe<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />hinda a̠huru nimui a hoge laco na Hwinsu buna bui na ca,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />zwama uma butaryage na bugyama bu boba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Ina i baniya na ina i yiwa na kurwa aco cinge kamu ai na ugan buna bwaba tane nu burya̠</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">, <verse eid="LUK 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />zwama buco labe buna ia̠gi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">i burya̠ iziya iuba i za magwata̠<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Yama iba hinda kurwo pa aco na yiwa na hoge iwasa uba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">pa sizwaga kurwo sizwaga. <verse eid="LUK 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Bware bu ia̠gi i burya̠ ni wa buba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Bware bu kanzigi aco ni azangi icwa buba ni ina aba ni hugi ni soo buba.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Hwinsu ui kanzigai mugwamgwam pa cigwama ci moba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">kwa na zangace aco ana ai sa ihya.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Hwinsu ui pan aco ai imiro i burya̠</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">hinda bu ance aco azaki siwa sirya.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Bu taimaki agyama buba Israila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">mabutaryagyabu hogo yama<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />na ibrahim na azwaga iba dudodu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">nga̠ buba hin na hacoco ahaci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Imaryamu i madale pa Alzabatu misali u pyana bitaco kwa na maringya giwu.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">An mace yohana i baptisma</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Nga mohon muba wuci muna Alisabatu aba ai mace bwa buba, amace bwa bu cware. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Nga̠ aco na dangi waiba aba hoge yama ina Hwinsu uba cibai nya̠ kwa aba na bagana nya̠ wawo.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Nga̠ buba wuci mohon utataco a kurya ana ia̠gi bwa kaciya, hinda a zane bware iziya i buca zakariya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />kwa Alisabatu na hin, &lt;&lt;Aye! ai zana Bware Yohana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Kwa aba na hin ne ba, &lt;&lt;Pa aco naboi aza buna boza iziya iniyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Kwa aco na ciba pa Zakariya alama na wa, bu zwama ga iziya ina aba ka̱ri ai zana bwa bu bware. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Kwa Zakariya na hin a kulageya bware i cihenro, kwa bware na hinlag &lt;&lt;Iziya i bwa Yohana.&gt;&gt; nga̠ aco aba hoge kwa aba na hoge mamaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ai sanuwo kwa uno u bware na magunja, hinda kwa bware na hya uno u cikarigo, bu hina i yabe Hwinshu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Kwa iwasa na konbe aco na ayiwa ciyabu naba, hinda ka̠mu aco ai ia̠g cinge ci Yahudiya aba na zwamag ini ka̠mu. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Tigaba ana a hoge ini a hoge mamaki, na kaban, &lt;&lt;Bwa buna bu ka̠ri san iri wanba?&gt;&gt; zwama wa u Hwinsu u yiwa na icwa i boba.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hazuga ha zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakariya buco bu Yohana a̠huru a Hwinsu a madale icwa boba kwa buba na ia̠ azwama abucuma bu Hwinsu:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;Ayabe Hwinsu, Hwinsu u Israila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">zwama u kurwa u cagago aco uba.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Hwinsu u cuma buco buna bui handgag aco uba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">na yaba bugyama bu ba Dauda<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />(nga̠ Hwinsu uba zwamage pa muno bucubago bu Hwinsu bu nagu ciri na mohun muna mu ali),<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />icagago pa acona ai ka̠ruwo mu hyanu amuci hinda na aco na a yiwa na gaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">na ga̠ci <verse eid="LUK 1:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Hinda Hwinsu u hyan ui cibai yama pa hacaca a haci</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">hinda u kucuna ku nagu ciri na uba iri ,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />kucuna kuna uba ma cone buca abuci Ibrahim:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />buci cagage na wa aco ai karuwo muhyanu amuci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">hinda isan ci laga ean na burya̠ na nagu wi wasa<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />na aco nagu ciri hinda na i burya̠ pa Hwinsu na mohon amuci ka̠mu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />&lt;&lt;Go, hinda bwa buna, ai bu ogana bucuma bu Hwinsu Zaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">zwama bui zwalago Bugwama bu juniya kimgage bo yina,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />bui zwana aco buba a daki icagago pa i curi magwata̱ ya aco,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />maka̠la̠ na yama Hwinsu nuci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">hinda ui korya a paci nga̠ malanga ma hwinshu masa ma kurya hwaciyo na zaro<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />u cibe haske pa aco na ayiwa na ci'incu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">hinda a yiwa na uhurhuru u uo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">a hubo buna naci kurwo laco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Yohana i monse hal i hoge koce na cikarigo ci Hwinsu; bu ma dale na ihugo ina iza mapucpuci kwa hon na buba sirya bu zwamaga Israila cikarigo ci Hwinsu .<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Maco u yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Na mohon muni kaisar Augustus u kole cicuma an a rutage aco ka̠mu na cinge ci Roma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />(Hunni masa rutagi aco na jigo, kwa Kiriniyus aba gwamna u siriya.) <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Tigab bu kure eog i buba zwama a tane iziya ibuba.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Isufu i sirya na ia̠g i Nazaret na suwa u Galili una u yiwa Yahudiya, kurwa u Baitalami na ia̠g Idauda, na zwama bware busa bu yaba i Dauda. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Isufu i kore na Imaryamu zwama a tane haziya hab,ina aba zabi bware iba Imaryamu hinda izase mukab. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Aba na Baitalami, kwa lokaci na eag una iba i mace bwa,<verse eid="LUK 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />kwa eba na mace bwa bu jigo bui bwa, bu cware. kwa eba na kubtagan bwa na ulapo kwa labuta na ukwami, zwama ai hinwo okaba i malabo na yaba hanyagata<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahub na acuma Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Na Baitalami aza ahuba̱ ciyabu na ihugo ina aba mace Yesu, an yiwa a̱pe u hatami na gita. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Kwa acuma Hwinsu na silta ga, hinda muson u Hwinsu u ringa ga, kwa aba na hoge iwasa dinyiya. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Kwa acuma Hwinsu na hyen nab, &lt;&lt;Ita huga iwasa. Na kulage cikarigo ci burya̠ na ikulage laco una ui san wai aco ka̱mu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Nawuya na i'ogo i Dauda ai maco buna bui handgag; iziya i buba Kristi Bugwam bu doone. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ina i san ga̠hi : I bangi bwa bu nadagi na halapoa labute bwa na kwami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Sa na cidako ciba kwa acuma Hwinsu na zaro na sirya kwa na bangi ina i jigo, na pa Hwinshu cilabe moba na zwamag,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Moshon u Hwinshu na zaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">hinda na cinge dala a burya̠ pa aco asa pa aco an Hwinsu uba yiwa na hog laco aba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Nga̠ acuma Hwinsu aba maryabi na ba kwa na maringya zaro, kwa ahuba na mazwaman, &lt;&lt;Ci aliyi Baitalami hyen ini ina i ia̠gi, ina i Hwinshu uba ci zwama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Kwa aba na mahuguzan kwa na bangi Imaryamu na Isuhu, na bwa, buna bu labuce na kwami. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Nga̠ aba hyan Yesu, kwa aba na cubaga ina aba hoge kamu zwama Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />hinda aco na hoge kamu mamaki u konbe ga ina ahub aba zwama ga. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ama Imaryamu kwa na komgag ka̠mu ina maba hoge hinda mab kwa hugi iri na shuwa u maba. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Kwa aco ihuba̠ na marigya, aba na cibage cilabe u Hwinshu zwama ina aba hen ina ioba i, tibe ka̠mu nga̠ aba zwamaga.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">A zane Yesu iziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Nga̠ mohon utataco muba sinji, hinda lokaci una aba ai ia̠gya bware kaciya, a zane bware iziya Yesu, iziya ina acuma Hwinsu aba tane bware kapi asgi mukab mu bware. <verse eid="LUK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Inga muhun mui isiro i ciriyo iba ya wuce nga̠ cikarigo ci Musa ciba hyen, Isufu na Imaryamu a zangi Yesu korwa Urshalima a cuta bware pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(Nga̠ aba rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu, &lt;&lt;Ka̠mu bwa bu cware bu jigo buna bwaba mace a onje bo na nagu ciri pa Hwinsu&gt;&gt;), <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />hinda ai pan sadaka zwama alaga ina cikarigo Hwinsu uba hin: &lt;&lt;mutarkagu murya ko mutantabara mu noya murya,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Baniya aza buco na Urshalima buna bwab ungwa Saminu, bu yiwa na lagana Hwinsu na cikarigo ci uba. Hinda bu yiwa a̠pe hona aba ai cata Israila, hinda Hwinsu u yiwa tare na bware. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ahuru a Nagu ciri a ia̠gi Saminu cikarigo an bu za ikwaji kwa bu hyan Bugwama bu doone Kristi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Hwinsu u i cikarigo na bware, kwa buba na ese iginga. Nga̠ amace bware aba a kole bwa Yesu zwama a i ina al'ada aba hyen ana a ia̠gi Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />kwa Saminu na ca Yesu na wa uboba na goje Hwinsu, na hyen:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />Bugwama bu doone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">nga̠ go bu i kucuna, bupwan cure bugyama abube bu ali lapiya.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Zwama na hyano icuwa i Hwinsu,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Haisa ahamui a hyan icuwo ina go bu iyi na haisa ha aco,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Busa kuce Hwinsu una u cibe Aco an ai yajuwa na go</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">hinda na izagacuwo ya aco Israila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Buca na amaci a Yesu a huge mamaki cikarigo ci Saminu aba zwamage . <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Saminu a tanega unu u burya̠ kwa na hyen na Imaryamu, amace a bware: &lt;&lt;Bwa buna a iri bwa zwama iheno na wasingeewo wa aco dinya na Israila, hinda usan ina iciba aco aba za ikari ai cikarigo ciba, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />hinda wai san yina una ui ciba hasoo ha aco dinya a daki. Hinda ipopo i sape suwa nuboi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Aza amaci ana asa bucuma bu Hwinshu, iziya yeba Hannatu, bwa bu Fanuwel, buna bwa azwaga Asher. A'ongo dinya; a i dala cigya haya utandare, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />kwa bware bu buba na kwaji hinda haya ha buba kope tataco na hanasi. Tohonba buba na iginga buba na lagan cikarigo ci Hwinsu na gita na hwinshu, buba naea cuonya na ahunda̱. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Inga̱ buba bwa es lokaci buni, nga̠ buba goji Hwinshu hinda kwa na ia̱ cikarigo bwa pa aco ana ayiwa a̱pe u icago Urshalima.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Inga Isuhu aba na Imaryamu aba hogi kamu ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyan ana a i, kwa aba na marige cinge ci Galili pa e'ogo yab Nazaret. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Bwa bu monse hinda bu hoge koce; bu hin mahans, hinda i burya̠ na koce Hwinshu uba na icwa bware dinya.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bwa na shuwa iginga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Tonba uya hacaca bware sa kore Urshalima zwama lago ui ikacigago. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Inga yesu eba sinji haya ikope na hare, kwa aba nakore ignga̠ nga̠ aba sabe na alada. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />nga̠ lago uba hogi kwa aba na laga yina u giwo, kwa yesu na yisan na Urshalima, hinda hacaca hai dakuwo. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Aba hinda a nga̠ an Yesu yiwa tare nab, kwa nga̠ aba i cihano ci ihon inka.Kwa aba na hinan ginbaga bware aco aba na si'osa. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Nga̠ aba ai hyanuwo bware, kwa aba na marigya Urshalima ginbo u bware. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Na hon u tacula kwa aba na bangi Yesu na iginga, na unsa u hawalami kwa bu madaliye, na sabulag hinda na ia̠gya han makab. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Aco na hoge Yesu ka̠mu a hoge mamaki nga̠ bware bub hinana icagano yaba. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Inga hacaca hab hyan bware, a hoge mamaki dinya. Kwa amaci a bware na hyen na bware, &lt;&lt;Bwa, be san go buci ia̱gi haruna? Buca abuboi na gya ci sano na gibo nibui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />&lt;&lt;Be san ga̠hin yiwa na ginbo nimui?&gt;&gt; Yesu i kaba. &lt;&lt;Bui dakuwo an u kamace gya yan na yaba i buca abumui?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Hinda ai dakuwo ina Yesu iba yiwa na zwamaga na ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Kwa Yesu na lagan ga kurwa u Nazaret hinda iba ea kamu ina aba hyen bu i. Hinda amaci abware a hina iwugi ka̠mu ini na suwa waba. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Hinda Yesu i hina musho na mahas na yama Hwinshu na aco.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohana i baptisma i kimuga yina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Na uya oi kope na uta una u Kaisar Tibariya aba na cugwama, hinda Buntus Bilatus abiya asase gwamna bu Yahudiya, hinda Hiridus aba na cugwama ci Galili, Filibus buhuwo bu bware buba na cugwama ci Ituriya ni Tarakunitas, hinda Lisaniyas aba na ci Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />hinda Hannana ni Kayapa abe sanse alabe labe, kwa Hwinsu na ea cikarigo na Yohana bwa bu Zakariya na hilo. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Kwa Yohana na ese tuhonba na usala u ujaba u Yodan, buba na eago cikarigo ci baptisma an a curi eewo nga̱ Hwinsu uba ui kimgana magwata̱ maba. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Nga̱ aba zwamage na utakad u bucuma bu Hwinsu Ishaya ana:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Uno uyiwa na oge na ihug ina iza mapucipuci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Kima̱gana yina a korwa pa Hwinsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">i cinbule cihano acihin.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Tunba ulanbu asinji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">tunba e'ogo na a'ogo a labte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Akimga hayina han hai gyamaco ha gyamace.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Hinda kamu aco ai hyan icagago i koce u Hwinsu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yohana i oga aco na matanago dinya gimbo bu egyi ga baptisma , &lt;&lt;ganhi inyaga na sihwa siwo! Ganba boi zwama an i shome kurwa ui hacigago shuwa u Hwinsu? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Eaja ina i ciba an i curu iwo. Ita zwamana sicwa ansihiyo, &lt;Ciza buca abuciyo Ibrahim. Ni zwama pa hatare hana Hwinsu u pwan isan ha san saawo si uba. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />A tane akyabuco ni ipicu e'on, kamu u'on una oi macuwa imata iburya̠ ai gunji on a kwama na shuwa ula.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />&lt;&lt;Bai gaci ci eagoga?&gt;&gt; aco na matanaga kabo Yohana.<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohana icanega kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Buna buza cilapo cirya bu kasiye buna buza, hinda buna buza mare bu i harbuni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Aco na cago ganju a kurya zwama a egyi ga baptisma. &lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; a kabo, &lt;&lt;Bai gaci ci eago?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Yohana i hyen nab ita ca ganju ina hwace ina aba hen na gahin i ce,&gt;&gt; bu zwamaga.<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Kwa moshoja na kaban Yesu &lt;&lt;Hinda baice ganci ea?&gt;&gt; Yohana u cane, &lt;&lt;Ita ciba aco koce ai pan musarya hinda ita galagana aco ina aba ai eaguwo- ita yagaga ina aba yiwa na cupaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Aco na yinsa na anpe u kurwa u Almasihu hinda ahina wugi na shuwa ko Yohana ibe isa Kristi. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Kwa Yohana nai canega, &lt;&lt;Gya ni egyi baptisma na miya.Ama buna zaki na koce buyiwa na kurwa, ni pwanuwa i pasingya hataka ha buba. Boi eagya baptisma na Anhuru a burya̠ na ula. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Bu kumbugage ubaka na wa ububa zwama bu pyase hanhin ha buba hinda tanaga kahogo na a'uri, bui hunkacum hapwo na ula una uza ikwaji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Na cikarigo dinya Yohana eba ia̠gi aco cikarigo ciburya̠.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Inga Yohana uba butiga gwamna Hiridus zwama Hiridus iziya Hirudiya bu'a bu buhunwo, hinda na cagiye eewo buba ia̠gi, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Hiridus a jidane ihacigag tibai: Kwa bware na san agunda Yohana na ukaba u ci'incu.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ia̠gi yesu baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Nga̠ Yohana eba ia̠gi aco ka̠mu baptisma, Yesu hinda a ia̠gi bware. Hinda buba na ahunda̠, kwa zaro na magunja, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />hinda a̠huru Aburya̠ Hwinshu kwa ni kanzigya na icwa Yesu inyaga na itantabara. Hinda a hoge cikarigo zata u zaro: &lt;&lt;Busa bwa a bumui, buna bu gya na ka̠ri; na goo gya ni yiwa ni hoge laco u buba dinyiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Baniya yesu iba na haya kopehataco bware buba rwage ibwana i Hwinshu. Aco zangi bware busa bwa bu Isufu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">bwa bu Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli hinda bwa bu Mattat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">bwa bu Lewi, bwa bu Malki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">bwa bu Yanna,Yanna bwa bu Isifu,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Isifu bwa bu Mattatiya, Mattatiya bwa bu Amos,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">bwa bu Nahun, Nahun bwa bu Hasli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">bwa bu Najaya, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Najaya bwa bu ma'ata,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">bwa bu Mattatiya, Mattatiya bwa bu Shimeya, Shimeya</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">bwa bu Yosek, Yosekbwa bu Yoda.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda bwa bu Yowanan, Yowanan bwa bu Resa, Resa bwa bu Zerubabel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">bwa bu Sheyaltiyel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">bwa bu Niri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Niri bwa bu Malki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">bwa bu Addi, Addi bwa bu Kosama,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">bwa bu Elmadama, Elmadama bwa bu Er,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er bwa bu Yoshuwa, Yoshuwa bwa bu Eliyezer,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyezer bwa bu Yorim, Yorim bwa bu Mattat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Mattat bwa bu Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi bwa bu Simeyon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simeyon bwa bu Yahuda, Yahuda bwa bu Isifu, Isifu bwa bu Yonam, Yonam bwa bu Eliyakim,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakim bwa bu Meleya, Meleya bwa bu Menna,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Menna bwa bu Mattata, Mattata bwa bu Natan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Natan bwa bu Dauda, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dauda bwa bu Yesse,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Yesse bwa bu Obed, Obed bwa bu Bowaz,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Bowaz bwa bu Salmon, Salmon bwa bu Nashon.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashon bwa bu Amminadab, Aminadab bwa bu Aram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">aram bwa bu Hezron, Hezron Ferez,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Ferez bwa bu Yahuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yahuda bwa bu Yakub,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakub bwa bu Ishaku, Ishaku bwa bu Ibrahim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Ibrahim bwa bu Tera,Tera bwa bu Nahor,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahor bwa bu Serug, Sherug bwa bu Reyu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Reybwa bu Feleg, Feleg bwa bu Eber,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Eber bwa bu Shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela bwa bu Kenan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kenan bwa bu Arfakshad, Arfakshad bwa bu Shem,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Shem bwa bu Nuhu, Nuhu bwa bu Lamek,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek bwa bu Metusela, Metusela bwa bu Enok,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Enok bwa bu Yared, Yared bwa bu Mahalalel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalalel bwa bu Kenan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenan bwa bu Enosh,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enosh bwa bu Set, Set bwa bu Adamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">bwa bu Hwinsu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Shetan a Ggwaji Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Inga Yesu eba maringe pa wo u jordan, na Anhuru a burya̠ ayiwa na bware, kwa anhuru a burya̠ na kula bware na ihug ina aza mapucipuci, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Apani aba gwaji Yesu a ea cu'oniya ihurumu kope nasi na gita kope nasi kwa shetan na gwaji bware. Yesu irewa ihya na muhun muniya, kwa imero ni kumbe bware.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Shetan a hyen na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Si busa bwa bu Hwinsu, kargyana tare una u maringiya mare.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu i cyane, &lt;&lt;Harbuni cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyen, sa ni mare maba buco buba bwe yana.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Shetan kwa na kula Yesu ni ihuga ina i zangari kwa ni ciba bware cigwama ci doone kamu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Kwa shetan ni hyen na Yesus, &lt;&lt;Nibu pana kanmu koce na cilabe, zwama kanmu ana pan cilabe na wa namu hinda ni pana tigamba buna bu gya ni ka̱ri. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Si bwe ni kuztana, isan niboi kamu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu i cani, &lt;&lt;Harbuni cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba rubuci: &lt; Kuztan bugwama bu duniya Hwinsu hinda laga buba buba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Na ihogu kanmu, Kwa shetan na zangi Yesu kurwa Urshalima kwa ni kula Yesu zata isomo iginga ilabe. &lt;&lt;Si busa bwa bu Hwinsu,&gt;&gt; Shetan a hyen, &lt;&lt;Kwaman ecwa nebu ni cinge. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Zwama arubuci ni cikarigo Hwinsu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Hwinsu ui sana acuma Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">abu huba ihya za nabu hyan;<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />ibu sak ni siwa sab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">zwama buna nubuya uta masupa ni tare.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu i cani, &lt;&lt;Arubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu: Ta eagya Hwinsu nubuya alala.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Inga shetan iba hoge kamu igwadagu i Yesu, kwa ne curya bware zwama honmaiwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">A wanje Yesu na Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Inga Yesu iba ya maringya na Galili na kuce Hwinsu, aco hoge labari u bware kamu ni cinge cini. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Yesu i cibage aco na muginga mu labe mu ba, hinda aco kamu pa bware cilabe.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Kwa Yesu ni kore nazaret, ihuga na bware buba bwa musa, hinda hun asabar bware bu ise muginga mulabe mu ba, nga̠ bware buba eagagu, nga̠ buba karanci. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Cikarigo ci bucuma bu Hwinshu Ishaya cina cab rubuci na utakada a pana bware. Inga buba gonje, kwa buba na hyan ihugo ina aba hyan:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />a̠huru a burya̠ a Hwinsu a yiwa na gya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">zwama ana tanga zwam gya numega</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">cikarigo ci burya̠ pa aco na za ihya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Ina cuma gya pasingi aco na aba gunda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">na ukaba uci'incugunje haisa ha rubo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">aco na aba dabi uwonbe gya pasingi ga,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Hinda gya zwama aco ana uya una u Hwinsu u ea una uba ui cagaga acoba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Kwa Yesu ni gunja cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina cyaba rubuci ni utakada, kwa ni ringagya buna bu ibagana iginga kwa ni madala. aco kamu ana ayuwa ni iginga kwa atani bware hisa, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Kwa Yesu ni hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Nawuya cikarigo cina a sinji ca na hacube a hanhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Ka̠mu waba ahuge laco cikarigo cina ci bware bu zwamage hinda a huge mamaki dinyiya ni cikarigo cina cya sira ni unu u bware. &lt;&lt;Kwa aba ni kabana, sa bwa bu Yusufu abuna?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu i cyaniga, &lt;&lt;Ni daki kamu ana ini zwama cikarigo cinacyaba hin: &lt;Likita, handgaga eco nibu ni mahuna! Hinda i hin ni gya ci egyi ina gaci huge ana bu iyi ni i'ogo nibui na Kaparnahun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />&lt;&lt;Ni zwama kamahinda,&gt;&gt; Kwa Yesu ni hin, &lt;&lt;Aza bucuma bu Hwinsu buna bui hyan maka̠la̠ ni i'ogo i buba. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Kamahinda ni zwama ni cinge ci Isra'ila aza si'a sina si sare sab siba kwaji harbuni hinda na hon u Iliya, Hwinsu uba gunda zaro sila i hinuwa hal haya hataco na rabi una aba iyi imero kamu na cinge. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Hinda Iliya i kuruwa pa bucahya kwa hu bu'a buna bu bware buba kwaji na Zarefat ina iyuwa na sala u sidom uba cuma bware. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Hinda aza aco mahuna ma cikuturu dinyiya ni Isra'ila lokaci u bucuma bu Hwinsu Iliya, Hinda i hwingacume ko buco bweka kwa dai Na'aman buco bu suriya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Inga aco ni iyuwa suwa iginga aba huge cikarigo ci Yesu kwa aba ne dabe suwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Kwa aba ni masinga, kwa ni ance bware ni e'ogo yab, kwa ni kula Yesu pa zata wa a'ogo ai og yab zwama a kwama bware na cinge. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ama kwa Yesu na alah ni suwa aco na matanago.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i ance mupyala mu owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yesu i ise ni suwa kaparnahun, i i'ogo ina i yiwa na Galili, hinda hun asabar bware hina ni cibaga aco. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Aco huge mamaki wui cibago bware dinyiya, zwama cikarigo ci bware ciza koce.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Inga Yesu iba ise ni suwa ui iginga ilabe bware bu bangi buco buna buza a̠huru a ciri. Kwa bware ni eag cikarigo ni koce, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;Wayo! biya ci gami gaci na goo, Yesu Inazaret? Bu kurya na cihunaga? Ni daki busa bwa bu Hwinsu buna bu za magwata̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />&lt;&lt;Otana!&gt;&gt; Yesu i cyane ni kuce. &lt;&lt;Sila na suwa u bware!&gt;&gt; kwa mupyala mu eewo ni pajigya bware ni cinge hinda kwa muba ni sire mui cumuwo iya.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Aco kamu huge mamaki kwa ni ma zwamana, &lt;&lt;iri wamba icibago haruna? ina iza koce hal bu karigyan mupyala mu wo hinda muba sire!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Hinda cikarigo cina ci Yesu buba iyi ci ise ni suwa usala u mu ogo uni kamu<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i handgagi aco dinya na mahuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Inga Yesu iba sire na iginga ilabe kwa bware ni kure ya Saminu. bware bu bangi kwasago Saminu ni mahuna ma zazabi kwa ni zwamana Yesu a huge yama kwasago. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Kwa Yesu ni kuzata ciyabo pa buco mahuna kwa ni kargyana mahuna mazazabi, mahuna kwa ni cura ga. kwa eba na halaga na masiga kwa na eagyaga mare.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ni yombe aco kulgagi Yesu aco mahuna ti'iri mamba , bware ni dangag na wa, kwa mahuna na curaga. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Hinda mupyala mu wo mu sire na aco dinyiya, muba ni sangan cu'og, &lt;&lt;Goo busa bwa bu Hwinsu!&gt;&gt; Yesu i hazane mupyala mu wo hinda bu gazga mu na cikarigo, zwama mu daki ana bware busa Kristi.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Nubongo ma'inta kwa Yesu ni kure ihug ina iza bucahya kwa ni mashon. Aco hina gimbo u bware nga̠ aba hyan bware, kwa aba na gazgan bware buta curakanaga. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Kwa Yesu na hyen, &lt;&lt;Una sana dole gya kure egyi aco mu'ogo mu maiwa cikarigo ci burya̠ ci cigwama ci Hwinsu, zwama ina san Hwinsu uba ana cuma bini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Kwa Yesu na hinan icibago cikarigo ci Hwinsu ni suwa muginga mu labe muna muyiwa na Yahudiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu i oga Silmajiri si jigo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Aza hona Yesu kwa iyisan na ugagi uwo u Janisarat, Aco hina na ma tanaga ciyabu pa bware zwama a hoge cikarigo ci Hwinsu, <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />kwa Yesu na hyan hajirigi ha miyan harya na ugagi uwo, hana ha aco ikumbago i muryage aba curi, ayiwa ni guzag hataro hai kunbago i muryage. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Kwa Yesu na ese, jirigi umiya uika̠, una usa u saminu, kwa na zwaman bware bu madajigane daga ihuga ina izwamuci. Inga bware buba madale kwa hinana icibaga aco ni suwa u jirigi.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Inga yesu eba hogi cikarigo, kwa bware na hin na Saminu, &lt;&lt;Madajigane ihuga ina izwamuci, goo kwama utaro ui konbago muryage nga̠ goo bui konbe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Saminu a cane, &lt;&lt;Buca bu yab, cihogi gita kanmu hinda ci kunbowa ihya.Ama nga̠ go buhyan na tana, utaro ui konbago imuryage.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Inga aba tane hataro hab, kwa aba na konbage murege dinya hal hataro hab nga̠ ha ka̱ri na ma handa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Kwa aba na ogan aco na yiwa jirigi u mewa a kurya abanga ga, kwa aba na sinji hajirigi harya na murege hal hajirigi ha ka̱ri ihibi.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Inga saminu Bitrus aba hyen ina egyi, kwa bware na kuzatan Yesu kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Ta kurya ciyabu ni gya, Bugwama bu Dwuniya; Gya nasa buco bu magwata̱!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Bitrus na aco na yiwa ni bware ahoge mamaki u imurege muna mu aba konbe, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />harbuni hinda iwasa ikonbe Yakub na Yohana, na saawo si Zabadi, na kalagi ka Saminu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Kwa Yesu na hyen na Saminu, &lt;&lt;Tahuga iwasa, baniya bwe san buna bwe kulagi aco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Kwa aba na kula hajirigi hab na ugagi uwo, kwa na curya ina aba yiwa na eago kwa na lagana Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihwingacume buco bu mahona macikuturu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Aza hona Yesu iba na e'ogo ahya, buco bu mahuna macikuturu mab konbe dinya. Inga iba hyan Yesu, kwa eba na kuzat sinu uiba na cinge kwa eba na one bware, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu Dwuniya, sibuyaje, buzi kuce ni hwingacume na huingacume.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Kwa Yesu na kula wa kwa na dango kuturu. &lt;&lt;Na yaje,&gt;&gt; na hyen. &lt;&lt;hoinga!&gt;&gt; Ai sanuwo kwa mahona macikuturu na curi bo.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Kwa Yesu na zwaman lea, &lt;&lt;Ta zwamana buciyohya,kwadi macibe pa alabe ai eogo hinda pan sadaka una u Musa uba hyen ana i pan aco u mahona amahin, zwama aco daki ana bu hoingo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Kanmu na haruni labari u ini Yesu iba iyi, aco dinya ahuge hinda kwa na korya a hungacume ga mahuna maba. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Hinda Yesu se i kore imaswinyi ihuga ina iza aco iba iyi ahunda.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i hwingacume buco bu mahuna ma amaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Aza hona Yesu iba na cibaga aco kwa Haparisyawa na hawalami hai cibago cikargo ci musa ana a silagi na hila u sala u Galili na Yahudiya na Urshalima, kwa madalage. Hinda koce u Hwinsu uba tare na bware zwama bu hwingacume mahuna. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Kwa aco na zangya buco bu mahuna ma amaci zata u cibaro a iyi kokari azubali bwa daidai pa Yesu iba yiwa na suwa yaba na cibago. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Inga aba mayage zwama aco na matanaga dinya, kwa aba na yindana zata wai isumo kwa na zubali buco bu mahona kanmu na cibaro kwa na lapta bwa na usa wa aco pa Yesu iba yiwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Inga Yesu iba hyan iyajo i suwab, kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;A'osa, a curu magwata̱ amaboi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Haparisiyawa na hawalami hai cibago i Musa ha rwage na mazwamana, &lt;&lt;Gamba buna buyiwa nai cwa Hwinsu? aza buna bu pwa icagaga buco magwata̱ kwa dai Hwinsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu i daki kamu ina aba yiwa na mazwamgan kwa bware ni kaban, &lt;&lt;Baisa ganhi yiwa na eag cikarigo na hasuwa ahanhi? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Bai zaki na sauki ni gya: a hyan, &lt;God abu handagago na magwata̱ amabwe,&gt; ko hinda a hyan, &lt;Masinge iyi cihano&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Baniya Zwama ganhi yidaki an bwa bu Hwinsu buza koce na cinge buba bwe handagaga magwata̱....&gt;&gt; Kwa Yesu na hyen na buco bu mahuna ma amaci, &lt;&lt;Nibu zwama, masinge, zangi cibaro aciboi aliyi giwo,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ai sanuwo kwa buba na masinga na usa wab, kwa ni zangaco cibaro cina cibuba bwa labce na ciba kwa na ala giyu buba na zangaca cilabe ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Aco kanmu a hoge mamaki kwa na hinan pan cilabe Hwinsu. wawo kubega dinya kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Ci hyano ina gaci cisaihyan nawuya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i uga Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Inga aba iyi ini kanmu, Yesu i sire kwa na hyan bucyagu bu ganju ize ibuba Lawi kwa bu madale na ukaba ui cago iganju. Yesu kwa na hyen na Lawi, &lt;&lt;Na laganya,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />kwa Lawi na masinga, a curi tibe kwa na lagana Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Kwa Lawi na eagya Yesu lago u labe na yaba bware, aco icyago ganju dinya a kore pa lago uni hinda cyagiya aco aba ni re mare na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ama na haparisiyawa na hawalami ha cibago Musa ana asa iyi bikan kwa haba na ea cikarigo na silmajiri si Yesu, &lt;&lt;Baisa ganhi na Yesu iyiwa ni re mare na sho na aco &lt;magwata̱&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Kwa Yesu ni cane ga, &lt;&lt;Aco na za mahuna aza gimbo u likita, kwa aco mahuna. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Na kurya oga aco nagu magwata̱, kwa aco magwata̱ acuri magwata̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaba Yesu zwama cu'oinya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Cyagi aco hyan na Yesu &lt;&lt;Silmajiri si Yohana si ia̱gu cu'oinya na ahunda̱, harbuni hinda silmajiri si haparisiyawa, ama silmajiri a sebo kwa ere ni so.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Kwa Yesu ni cane ga, &lt;&lt;Buna buza amaci na earo bui bonge na imirwa? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ama lokaci u yiwa na kurwa aba ai zangi amaci a curi saawo. lokaci buni aba ai ia̱ga cu'oinya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu zwama ga misali: &lt;&lt;Aza buna bwe hanje azuz na cilapo cipu a ia̱gi cina ci onga zwama yitagi ci pu na azuzu a i paci. Si bu iyi, bui hanje cilapo pu, hinda ihuga ina aba ia̱gi paci iza ma ia̱ na ci gose na cipu <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Aza buna bui halana usubuga na suwa hagwala ha guse. Si iyi haruni ugwala ui ma pusi, u subuga ui puni hinda ugwala ui ma pusi hinda usubuga uma jigi. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Kwadi, a hala u subuga upu na ugwala upu. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Aza buna bui ka̱ri bu so subuga su urigyana wa suwa alanda, zwama bui hyan, &lt;&lt;Alanda azaki na burya̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Makabo hon ihonpacu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Aza hon Asabar Yesu na silmajiri alaga ugagi u enta u Oni, kwa silmajiri ni hinana iwadag Oni na susbyag aba ni re. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Ha cyagiyawa Haparisawa hamewa na kabana, &lt;&lt;Baisa ganhi iyiwa na eago ina icibago i Musa iba gaz hon Asabar?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Kwa yesu na cane ga, &lt;&lt;I karancuwa ina Dauda uba i aba aco bware hon na aba hoge imerwa? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Kwa Dauda na ese yaba Hwinsu, hinda bu zangi mare mana masa ma pishu, bo re mare mana mab iri zwama Alabe kwa ni ihoga aco na yiwa tare nab aba ma re.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Kwa Yesu na hyen nab, &lt;&lt;Bwa bu buco busa bugwama bu Dwuniya wa Asabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Inga asabar amenwa aba amaringe kwa Yesu na ese na iginga ilabe buba na cibaga, aza buciyahya buna bu mahona ma amaci aba konbe bo wa. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Ha parisawa na hawalami hai icibago i Musa ha yanse ginbo yina hab hai konbe Yesu ni laipi, kwa aba ni hinana ilagan bware a hyan si bware bwe handgag aco mahona hon Asabar. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ama yesu idaki ina aba yiwa ni zwamag na shuwa wab kwa na hyen na buco bu mahona ma amaci aba konbe wa, &lt;&lt;Masinge yinsa no usa wa aco.&gt;&gt; Kwa buba na masinge kwa na yinsan.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Kwa Yesu na kaba nab,&gt;&gt; hun i hupaco ci ia̠gi i burya̠ ko eewo? ci caga a̱huru a buco ko ci huni buco<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Kwa Yesu na byanega kamu waba, kwa na hyen na buco bu mahona, &lt;&lt;Danda wa nibui.&gt;&gt; Kwa bware na ia̠go nga̠ aba hyen na bware, kwa wa boba na marige nga̠ eba yanse. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Kwa ha soo haba ni dabi kwa aba na mazwaman ina aba ai eage Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i tanga Silmajiri sirya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Aza hon na yesu eba kore ciyabu na eogo zwama bu i ahunda, zwama bu hogi gita buba na eaga anhunda pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Nga̠ ubungwa ub bonge, kwa Bware na oga Silmajiri si buba kwa tangana silmajiri ikope na sirya, kwa buba na zane ga iziya ana manzani: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />saminu (buna buba zane iziya Bitrus), na buhunwo bu bware Andarawus, na Yakub, na Yohana, na Filibus, na Bartalomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />na Matta, na Toma na Yakub bwa bu Halfa, na Saminu an aba yiwa ne oge buna bu yiwa na isibu icinge ceba, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />na Yahuda bwa bu Yakub, na Yahuda Iskariyoti, ina i cutan Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uno u burya̠ na uno uwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Kwa Yesu na kanziga na silmajiri si bware kwa na yinsana na ihugo ina isa pini. Silmajiri si bware sina si ma tanaga dinya na aco dinya ana asa aco cinge ci Yahudiya, na Urushalima,na usala u Tayana Sidon ana ayiwa ugagi uwo, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Aco na akurya i hoge cikarigo ci bware hinda a hwingacume ga pa mahona maba. Na aco na mupyala mubadame ga, <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Aco Kamu ayi kokari adangi bware, zwama ikoce ina iywa na ikanga ihina ni hwingacuma aco kanmu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Inga buba byane silmajiri si boba, kwa na hyen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">&lt;&lt;Unu uburya̠ usa nuhin aco na za ihya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">zwama cigwama ci Hwinsu isa yaba.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Unu burya̠ usa wa aco na yiwa na hoge imirwa baniya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">zwama ai sigacuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Uno u burya̠ usa wa aco na yiwa na cidaro baniya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">zwama ai same laco.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Uno u burya̠ usa nuhin gahin buna aco ba ai karuwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ga buna wab hanjiye aba ai conye hinda aba hyen ana gahi isa aco wo,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="LUK 6:22">zwama gya bwa bu Hwinsu.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />&lt;&lt;Sa ai egyi haruni hogaje laco, zwama iza lada u labe na zaro. Zwama hacaci harbuni hacaca hab ia̱gi Acuma Hwinsu.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Hinda aco na za jukiya baniya a iso taco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">zwama a rigyano a ciwa laco waba.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Aco na aza isiga baniya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">a iso taco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">zwama imirwa ikonbe ga. I iso taco aco na yiwa same laco baniya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">zwama suwa u siri na cidaro ci san cab.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />I iso taco sa aco ka̱mu a zwamage cikarigo ci burya̠ a kan ganhi, zwama harbuni hacaco hab ia̱gi acubago cibya acibe.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maka̱la̱ ma aco na ai karunwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />&lt;&lt;Ama ni zwama: ka̱la̱ aco na buwonje, ia̱gya aco na buwonje i burya̠, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />tana aco na ayiwa na buca nu burya̠, ia̱gya aco na yiwa ni bu pan wahal a̠hunda a burya̠ . <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Sa buciyahya buba mare, bickagyabo na usuga u mewa. Sa buco bu bucage cilapo ci labe, ta gazgana bwa ni caga cilapo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Ta yasa buna bu une ehya, hinda sa abu cage ina sa nibuya, ta kabokana. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Eagi aco nga̠ go bu ginbo a bu eagyi.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />&lt;&lt;Sibu ka̱ri aco na bu ka̠la̠, unba i burya̠ bu hin? &lt;Aco magwata̱&gt; a ka̠la̠ aco na ka̱ri ga. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Hinda si bu ia̠gu i burya̠ pa aco na bu ia̠gagu i burya̠, unba wawo goo bu hin? &lt;Aco magwata̱&gt; ma ia̠gu haruni. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Hinda sibu pangano utase pa aco na goo bu ginbago abu cope na i burya̠, unba wanwo ugo bu hin? Zwama &lt;Aco magwata̱&gt; apangano &lt;Aco magwata̱,&gt; utase si tani soo ai cupe ga ka̠mu. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ama ka̱la̱ aco na ai bu ka̠ruwo, ia̠gya ga i burya̠, hinda pan ga utase ta gibaga a bu cupe. Lada nubi ui monse, hinda i san saawo sa Hwinsu na zaro, zwama su ia̱gi aco na za gojiya na aco wo i burya̠ . <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Hog yam, nga̠ buca abuhin buba za yama.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ita pana aco magwata̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Yesu ni hyen ita ia̠gya aco shara'a, hinda aza na bu ia̠gya. Ta pana aco magwata̱, hinda aza ni bu pana laipi. Yapya aco na bu ia̱gi magwata̠, hinda ai bu yapya. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Pan daje, hinda goo ma ai bu pana. Cimano ci burya̠ cina ci sinje hal no ujigagu, man magane abu halage na cilapo. Ni ikwano ina goo bu mane, ibe aba ai bu magya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Kwa Yesu na ia̠ga ga kwatanci: &lt;&lt;Buruba bui pwana ikaji buruba? Ka̠mu waba aza matana na ugabugabu? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Bwa bu makaranta bui zakuwa walami u buba, kwa di buna aba cibage bwa dakago bui san nga̠ walami u buba.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />&lt;&lt;Besan goo bu hyan kidabdab na iyisa i kacage a kabo hinda goo bumayage na hyan ugunguri una u yiwa na iysa nibui? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Neya goo bui hyan na kacage akabo, &lt;Buhun, yinsana na bu zacige kidabdab na iyisa nibui,&gt; goo hinda bui hyanuwo ugunguri una u yiwa na haisa a habuya? Gooo malapuki, rwaga izaciga ugunguri na iyisa nibui, hinda goo bui hyanag na burya̠ biniya goo zacige daba na iyisa i buhun abubui.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">o'on na imat uba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />&lt;&lt;O'on u burya̠ uza imace imata wo, hinda o'on uwo uza imace imata iburya̠ . <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Timba o'on sa daki owa pa saawo siba. Aza iwaje saawo su ucwocwo pa udaku, ko inabi pa kware. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Buco bu burya̠ busa bu silacume i burya̠ ina i yiwa suwa u buba. Zwama ina buba iri na soo u buba ube uno uba ui zwamage.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aco ima mahans na ana za mahansa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />&lt;&lt;Bai san ga̠hi i yiwa na oga, &lt;Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu, Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu,&gt; hinda ai iwo ina gya na hyan ana a i? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Ni ciba nga̠ buba nyaga buna bwa kure ahwamui hinda bu huge cikarigo acimui hinda bu iyi nga̠ gya ni hin a iyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Bu nyaga na buco buna bu ma yaba buba, buna bu zwamti ipicu ema bu hitagi na hatare. sila a hayne dinyiya kwa hajaba na kule kwa na puse mugot, miya ma supi yaba hinda yaba i majumuiwo, zwama amgya na burya̠. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Kamu buna bu huge cikarigo acumui hinda bui iyiwo ina gya na hen ana bu iyi bu nyaga na buco buna bu iyi ma yaba buba na uhega una waba izwamtiwo ipucu ema. Nga̠ mupyala mu kuce mu kure mu supe yaba, Kwa yaba ne hine na cinge i ganuwa ko ni ihya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu i hwingacume bugyama bu soja u roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Nga̱ yesu iba hoge zamagana aco cikarigo, kwa bware na ise Kaparnahun. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ahwayiyo aza bugyama bu isoja ilabe, buna bu buco bu yaba bu buba bu yaji na buba dinyiya, bwe hugowo laco nga̠ bu ka̱ri kwaji. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Isoja ini ilabe i huge labari Yesu hinda kwa iba na cumana aco labe a yahudawa pa bware, an a zwama bware bu kurya bu hwingacume bugyama bu buba mahuna. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Inga aba a kure pa Yesu, A uni bware, &lt;&lt;Buco buna busa buco bu burya̠, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Zwama bu ka̱la̱ cinge acici hinda buma muginga mu labe dinyiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Kwa Yesu ni kure naba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Zwama yaba niya i miriwa huna soja ilabe iba cuma a usa eba pa Yesu: &lt;&lt;Buca̠ bu yaba, Tamadama, zwama gya ni jibuwa goo kurya̠ ni yaba numuya. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ube usa gya ni hyan ni jubuwa gya kurya̠ ahwabuya. Zwama cikarigo, hinda bugyama ahwamuya bwe hwinga. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Zwama gya ma niza buna buni zaki na koce, ni musoja muna yiwa imya ni gya. Se zwama ika, &lt;Kurya̠,&gt; Hinda iba kurya. Se hya ni bugyama abumui, &lt;Ia̠g harbuna,&gt; Hinda iba iyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Inga Yesu aba hugi haruniya, bware bu hugi mamaki u buba, kwa bware ni mabicika, kwa ni hin naba, ani i yiwa ni lagana bware, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda ni zwama, nasa tabuwa i hyan buna bu tani soo ka̱mu ni Israila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Aco na aba cuma kwa ni maringya ni yaba abangi bugyama bwa hwinga.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a yasinge bwa buna bu bware bu buba kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Wa sanuwo, Yesu ya kure ni iogo ina aba oga Nayin, silmajiri si bware na aco dinyiya a kure na bware. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Nga̱ Yesu bwa yabtani i'eba i'ogo, bware bu magami na aco ana a zangi buna bo kwaji, buba amaci aba maci hinda buza bware. aco i'ogo a laga iya. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hyan iya, kwa yama ni kunbe bware, &lt;&lt;Curo cidaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Kwa Yesu ni kure ni danga makar, aco na a zangyab kwa ni yisa. Kwa bware ni hin, &lt;&lt;Bulagasa, ni hin na goo masinge!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Buna bu kwaji kwa ni masinge kwa ni hinan cikarigo, Yesu kwa ni panan amaci a buba.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Ka̱mu aco na yiwa kwa aba ni huge mamaki kwa ni pana Hwinsu cilabe. &lt;&lt;Bucibago bulabe bu Hwinsu bu kurwa ni gacu,&gt;&gt; Aba kwa ni hyen. &lt;&lt; Hwinsu u kurwa i banganu i aco wab.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Cikarigo ci Yesu ci lagan ka̱mu i'ogo i judiya ni mo'ogomuni mu ringa ka̱mu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Yohana u baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Silmajiri si Yohana si zwama Yohana ka̱mu ina Yesu iba ia̱gi. Kwa bware ni uga silmajiri sirya, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Yohana bu cumaga pa Yesu a kaba, &lt;&lt;Gabuya busa buna bu yiwa na kurwa, kodai ci a̱pa bucagiya buco?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Nga̠ silmajiri si Yohana siba kure pa Yesu, kwa aba ni hin, &lt;&lt;Yohana u baptisma ocucuma cibu kaba, &lt;&lt;Gabuya busa Kristi buna bu yiwa na kurwa kodai ci a̱pa bucagiya buco?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Na lokaci uni Yesu a hwingacume aco mahuna dinyiya, na mahuna ma mupyala ma wo, aco ana a rubo hisa kwa ni gunja. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Kwa Yesu ni cane silmajiri si Yohana, &lt;&lt;Maringijo izwama Yohana ina ga̱hi hin na ina ga̱hi hoge: Arubo ahyanagi, agunu a jabagi, hakuturu hwinge, ana a hugaguwo a hugagu baniya, ana Kwadagi a masige, cikarigowo ci laco ana aza ihya a huge cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Uno u burya̠ usa pa buco buna bwa na wunjuwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Nga̱ silmajiri si Yohana siba aliyi kwa bware ni rwaga eagya aco cikarigo ci Yohana: &lt;&lt;I kure ni hila i hyani ia̱gya? Humbe ha zangari ana mupyala muba hurpana? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Si sa harbuniya, Ya kure hyan beya? Buna bu mabwada hazuga haburya̠ ? Aye, ana a mabwada hazunga ha burya̠ si madale na hoge laco na yaba bugwama. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ama gamba ganhi kore hyan? Bucuma? Harbuni, Ni zwama, buna bu zaki bucuma. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Na cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci rubuci game na Yohana:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">&lt;&lt; &lt;Na cumana bucubago buba sange na kuro kafin gowo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">buna bwe kimgag yina kafin goo, kure.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu i jidane i zwame, aco na si'a siba matange aza buna bugagi moswa nga̠ Yohana; Ka̱mu ni harbuni buna busa bu noya na ihug ina i Hwinsu uba sa Bugwama bu zake Yohana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />(Ka̱mu aco na hoge Yesu na hawalani icyagu iganju, nga̠ aba hoge cikarigo ci Yesu, a yaje na cikarigo ci Hwinsu cibe cisa ci burya̠, zwama a Yohana ube u ia̱gi ga baptisma. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ama haparisiyawa na hawalami ha cibago cikarigo ci Musa a wanje ina Hwinsu i paga, zwama a yajuwa Yohana u ia̱gi ga baptisma.)<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Yesu ni jidana hin, &lt;&lt;To, niya gya na gama aco zamani una? a nyaga niya? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />A nyaga na saawo sina si madale na kasuwa aba na ma'ugan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ci hulaganu arewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">i wanje ci'hibo ci zugi hazuga ha uo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">i wanje dara.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Zwama Yohana u baptisma u kore wa ryagwa mare ko wa soguwa moro, ama i hyan, &lt; bware buza mupyala mu wo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Bwa bu buwama bu kurya bu re mare bu sho na ga̱hi, ama i hyan, ,Bware buza ucoku bware bu swag hinda, aboki a hawalami haganju hinda na aboki aco &lt;&lt;Eewo.&gt;&gt; &gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ka̱mu na harbuniya aco na yaje na mahansa ma Hwinsu na icibago u ba asa aco burya̠ .&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Yaba Siman bucago bu ganju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Buika ciki a Parisiyawa bu uga Yesu a kure a re mare na bware, kwa bware ni yaba u baparisi u madale re mare ni tebur. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Aza bu'a buna bu yanse na dala eewo i hoge ana Yesu a yiwa ni yaba u baparise na re mare, kwa ibe na kule ikwalaba imanube ma musare dinya na kamshi mana aba ogo alabsta, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Kwa iba na yisan ciyabu ni bware kwa ibe ni hukan ni buna ibe na darya, iwalacumi buna bware ni miyisa. i hina ni susuryaga bware miyisa ni cihinji ciyab, i hina ni susryaga buna bware i hala turare na buna bware.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Nga̱ Baparise buna bu uga bware ire mare buba hyan ina ia̱gi kwa bware mazwaman ni suwa u bware, &lt;&lt;Si buco buna bu sa acubago a Hwinsu, bui daki buna bu dangagu bware hinda bu'a buna busa iri bamba- busa bu eewo.<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu a cyane bware, &lt;&lt;Siman, Niza ina gya nibu zwamana.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt; Ni zwamana, walami,&gt;&gt; Saminu bu hyen.<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />&lt;&lt;Yesu i hin aco barya aba lagana utasa u musare. Buika a lagana bwa utase nera dari uta, bucyagiye nera kope ta. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ka̱mu waba ama yage ni cupe utasa una aba laganab, kwa bware ni curgagya ga utasa. Baniya gamb bui zaki ni ka̱ri bware?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Saminu a cyane, buna aba curgagya bo utase dinyiya bube bui zaki huge laco.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">&lt;&lt;Bu cyane daidai,&gt;&gt; Yesu a cyane.<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Kwa Yesu na byane bu'a kwa ni hin ni Saminu, &lt;&lt;Bu hyan bu'a buna? Ni kure ni yaba nibu. Bwani panuwo miya guzagi buna nimui, amma icwape buna nimui ni miyisa kwa ni isusuryaga ni cihinji ci icwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Bui na sanuwo na maka̠la̠, ama bu'a buna tun lokaci gya ni ise, bui curiwo isusryago ibuna nimu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Bui na halanuwa manube ni icwa nimui, ama ini hala tulare u musare dinyiya ni buna nimui. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Zwama harbuniya Yesu i hin, nibui zwama, eewo eba dinyiya Hwinsu u yape bu'a buna- zwama i ka̱ri dinyiya. Ama buna aba yape cimu bu ka̱ri cimu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Kwa Yesu na hin neba, &lt;&lt;Hwinsu u yape bo eewo buba ka̱mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Acagiyaco Aco na yiwa ni re mare ni bware kwa ni hyan sucwa saba, &lt;&lt;Gambuniya buna bu si yape aco eewo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu kwa ni hin ni bu'a buni, &lt;&lt;Itano i soo nibui ibu cagago; Ala dudu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Misali buco bu cikaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Lokaci cimu, Yesu a hina ni ango ni mu'ogo muna kurwa cyage mu'ogo, bware ni cubag cikarigoci burya̠ ci cigwama ci Hwinsu. silmajiri ikupe na sirya siyiwa tare ni bware, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na si cyage si'a sina aba hwingacume mupyala mu wo na mahuna dinyiya: Maryamu (mana aba uga Magadalin) muna mu mupyala mu eewo tandarya mu sire ni ikanga mu eba; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Ni Yuwana bu'a bu Kuza, bube busa bulabe ni yaba bu bugwama Hiridus; Ni Suzana; Ni si cyage si'a. Si'a sina siyiwa na panganiga ni ina aba zi zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Inga aco dinyiya hinan na tanagan hinda aco ni kulagi pa Yesu ana a silagi mu'ogo, kwa bware ni eagyaga cikarigo ni misali: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Aza hon buco bu ita bu kure cikaba ni biro. Inga buba hina cikaba, cyage biro i hine na yina; aco punjagi, hinda muwuno mu zaro kwa ni re. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Icyage biro i hene pa hatare, hinda nga̠ bi yapuci, kwa ibe ni padal zwama cinge ciza ciduwu. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Icyage biro i hine pa ihuga ina izi kware ipuci kwa ni musi tare i kware kwa ni shaka biro <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Icyage biro hinda i hine pa cinge ci burya̠ . Inga ibe ya puci kwa ni ia̠ga̠ imate i kubani dari izake mos ina aba kabe.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Inga bware bu zamage haruni, kwa bware ni hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Buna buza hacube he hugo, bwa huge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Kwa silmajiri ni kaban bware bu zwama sa ma'ana ma misali. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Kwa Yesu ni hyen, &lt;&lt;Na dakacum i cusui ci cigwama co Hwinsu ai pan, ama cyagiya aco si iyi cikarogo ni misali, zwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ai hyan, hinda aza hyanaga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">ehuge hinda aza ganya.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />&lt;&lt;Ma'ana ma misali mani aman: Ibero ibe isa cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Ina hine na yina isa aco ni huge, hinda kwa shetan ni kure kwa ni zangi cikarigo ci Hwinsu na hasuwa haba, nga̠ aba za yage a hen ceto. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Ina hine na hatare isa aco ana ce cikarogo ci Hwinsu ni wa̱wo, nga̠ aba huge cya, ama aza haganda. A yaje na lokaci cimu, ama lokaci aba gwajiga kwa aba na hine. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Ibero ina hine pa kware asa nga̠ aco na ahuge cikarogo ci Hwinsu, ama nga̠ aba aliyi cidama ci doone ci sinji suwa waba, itanaganu iyi duniya ni ihugo laco, hinda ai musangya. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ama iberona iheni na cinge ci burya̠ isa aco na aza hasuwa u burya̠ , ana huge cikarigo ci Hwinsu, kwa ni kumgagaci, hinda kwa ni pani imata dinya.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali wa apicila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />&lt;&lt;Aza buna bwe kato apicila bu tani ni suwa wuitako ko hinda bu iri an ni imiya gado. Kwa dai bu jukai ah ni huga na aba ilago upicila, zwama aco na a isa na suwa a hyan haske. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Aza ina yiwa ni cisui ina aba za dakacuma aco, hinda aza ini yiwa na cisui ina aza dakacuma aco ko hinda asalacumya gya nijabu. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Zwama harbuni masikai nga̠ guwo bu saplaga. Buna buza i jidanab dinya; hinda buna buza, ina buba hin ma ana buza e cyagag.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amaci a Yesu na buhun bu bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Inga amaci a Yesu na hunwa bware a kure pa bware, ama apunuwa hyen bware zwama upugo wa aco. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Kwa bucyahya ni hyen ni Yesu, &lt;&lt;Amaci nabuya na huwa nubuya ayuwa ni jyabu, ayiwa ni gimba bu hyan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Kwa Yesu ni cyani, &lt;&lt;Amaci namu na ahun namu abe asa aco na huge cikarigo ci Hwinsu hinda a iyi ina ciba hyen ana a iyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i buta mupyala na uwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Aza hona Yesu iba hyan ni silmajiri seba, &lt;&lt;Ci mu kaciye ukacaso u uwo.&gt;&gt; Kwa aba ni ise na jirigi kwa ni ala. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Aba na cihano, kwa malabo ni tagan Yesu. Asanuwo mupyala mu sila mu kuce ni masigaye na suwa uwo, hal mupyala mu kari sana jirigi ihibi, hal iwasa ikubega dinyiya.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Kwa silmajiri ni zime bware, kwa ni hyen, &lt;&lt;Buca, bu yaba Buca, bu yaba, ci karo kwadaga!&gt;&gt; Yesubu masige kwa ni butan mupyala ni miya ma uwo; mupyala kwa ni hene, hinda tibai kamu kwa ni otana. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />&lt;&lt;Itanno isuwa nihi iyiwa humba?&gt;&gt; Yesu i kaba silmajiri si buba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Ni iwasa ni mamaki kwa aba na makaban, &lt;&lt;Gamba buna? buna bu buta ka̠mu na mupyala ni miya, hinda mu huge bwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">I hwingacuma buco mahuna ma apesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu ni silmajiri si buba a aliyi ni jirgi u miya kurow usala cinge ci Hagarasinawa una ukacasu uwo u Galili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Nga̠ Yesu uba kasingi ni jirigi u miya, kwa aba ni jubaga na buca bu apisa buna bwa sire i'ogo. Buca bu apisa buni bu sano buba na ange kasuju bwa madala ni suwa yaba, bu madalagu ni suwa u hazi. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Inga buba hyan Yesu, kwa buba ni danda bicwaro kwa ni kuzata pa Yesu, Kwa ni san cu'og, &lt;&lt;Bu gimbago biya ni gya, Yesu, bwa bu Hwinsu u zaro? Zwama Hwinsu, tani pana wahala!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Zwama Yesu ibuta mupyala mu wo mu sire ni ikanga i buca bua apisa. Tunbuho, si apare bware ni mari mari, ni buna na siwa hinda asa buna bui apanab, Aza huna buba na kakasa mari, hinda mupyala mu eewo si zangi bwa ihugo ini yasa iburya̠ .<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu a kaba buco, &lt;&lt;Ize nibu gamba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">&lt;&lt;Iculanu,&gt;&gt; buca bu apisa bu cyane, zwama siljanu dinyiya si isa ni suwa bware. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Kwa mupyala ni une Yesu ana buta sana a amatane na ulambu una u zwambuci dinyiya.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ciyabu ni ihuga ni aba yiwa silade si yanse ni hubo ni ugagi wui i'ogo. kwa siljanu ni une Yesu bware curesa si ise ni suwa silade, kwa bware ni yaji. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Inga siljanu siba sa sire ni suwa buco bu apesa, kwa ni ise ni suwa silade, hinda garke silade kwa ni yamani munda kwa ni matani ni suwa uwo kwa ni kwadaga.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Inga ahuba silade aba hyan ini iyi, kwa ni yamanimunda kuro ugo kwa ni zwamani aco ini iyi, <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />kwa aco ni sire ama hyani ina iyi. nga̠ aba a kure pa Yesu, kwa ni bangi buco bu apesa buna bwa bu lacume siljanu, kwa bu madale ciyabu ni yesu, kwa bu mabwadga hazunga ha burya̠ ; kwa iwasa ni kumbega. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Aco kanmu ni hyan a zwamage ka̠mu nga̠ aba hwingacume buco bu apesa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Kwa aco kamu i'ogo i Hagarasinawa ni zwamani Yesu ani i curega, zwama iwasa i kumbega dinyiya. Kwa bware ni ise ni jirigi kwa ni mawalan.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Buco bu apisa kwa ni une Yesu ana bu laga iya, ama Yesu kwa ni wanje kwa ni hyen na buba ani bu mawalani, kwa ni hin, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;Ala giyu zwama aco yaba nubuya ina Hwinsu uba ia̠gi.&gt;&gt; kwa buco bu apisa ni ala kwa zwamgana aco mu'ogo ka̠mu ina Yesu iba ia̠gyaga.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikangaza ina ikwaji ni bu'a buna bui huguwa laco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Nga̠ yesu iba ya maringe, aco dinyiya ama tanaga ni wawo u bware, ni zwama a yase ni gimba u bware. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Kwa bucahya buna aba yiwa ni uge Yayirus, buna busa bu labe pa iginga i labe, bu kure kwa ni kuztan Yesu, bu une bware ani bware kure ni yaba buba <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />zwama bwa buba bucu'a bweka, buna buzi haya kupe na arya, bu gimba i kwaji. Yesu iba na yina u kuruwa yaba i Yarus, aco ni matanaga a humani bware bu kari nagi huga bu bwe ala. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Aza bu'a buna bwa iyi haya kope ni harya na mahuna ma ijikon mahya dinyiya, bui hinwa buna bui pa hwingacuma bwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Kwa buba ni maringe kacuta ka Yesu kwa ni danga cilapo ci Yesu, hinda kwa mahya na curi na majiga mahi ni curo bwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />&lt;&lt;Gamba buni dangi?&gt;&gt; Yesu i kaba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Tigamba ka̠mu bu hyi ana bui dakuwo, Bitrus kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Buca bu yaba, aco na matanaga una hinda nibu mumuza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ama yesu i hin, &lt;&lt;Azi buna buni dangiyi; zwama ni huge ikuce isire ni ikanga nimui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Inga bu'a, buba hyan akari ganigebwa, Kwa buba ni kure ni cidagaro kwa ni kuzatan pa Yesu. Ni hyisa haco kamu kwa buba ni zwamag inasa buba danga bware hinda nga̠ buba halagi hwinga. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Kwa Yesu ni hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Bwa, itanu nibu suwa ibu hwingacuma. Ala lafiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu iba ni cikarigo, kwa bucohya buna bwa sire ni yaba Yayirus, buco bu labe bu iginga ilabe. &lt;&lt;Bwa bu cu'a abuba bu kwaju,&gt;&gt; Kwa ni hin. &lt;&lt;Ta dama; tani suwa nibu walami ai hwingacuma iya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Nga̠ Yesu iba huge, kwa ib na hyen ni Yayirus, &lt;&lt;Ta huga iwasa; tana suwa, hinda anhuru bwa abubwe i maringe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Inga Yesu iba wuci yaba i Yayirus, bware bwe yajiwo bucohya bu ise pa bwa buna bu kwaji na buba kwa di Bitrus, Yuhana na Yakub, ni buco bu bwa na amaci abuba. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Hinda, aco kamu aba ni darya bwa. &lt;&lt;Curyaji cidaro,&gt;&gt; Yesu kwa ni hyen naba. &lt;&lt;Bui kwajuwo iyiwa ni malabo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Kwa aba ni saman bware, zwama a daki ana bu kwaju. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ama Yesu kwa ni kumbe wa wu buba kwa ni hyen, &lt;&lt;Bwa bu mui, masige!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ahuru abuba kwa ni maringe, hinda i sanuwo kwa buba ni masiga. Kwa Yesu ni hyen ana apa bo mare bu re. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Hacaci ha huge mamaki dinyiya, kwa bware ni hyen naba buta zwamana bucayahya ini iyi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu i cuma silmajiri seba kupe na sirya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Aza hona Yesu iba uga silmajiri siba ikupe na sirya, kwa bware ni paniga koce ini yaba aba ai aci siljanu ni hwingacume mahuna, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Hinda Yesu cumaga a ia̠gi aco cikarigo ci cigwama ci Hwinsu hinda a hwingacume aco mahun. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Kwa Yesu ni hin naba: &lt;&lt;Ita zanga ko ni ihya pa cihano cina- ko agungu, ko ipamo, ko mare, ko musare, ko cilapo ci lagi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ka̱mu iyaba ni ganhi ise, i yisa apayi kwa hun u gahi sira ni i'ogo niya. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Sa aco i sanuwo ni kuruwa, susuryaga cinge cina ciyiwa na buna nihi isire ogo yaba, wai sana sheda wahi paba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Kwa aba ni masiga kwa ni ala hinda kwa aba ni lagan muyaba yaba, aba ni zwamaga cikarigo ci Hwinsu hinda ni hwingacuma aco ni mahuna kamu ihuga ni ya kure.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Inga Hiridus bugwama bu Galili aba huge ina Yesu iba iyi. Kwa bware ni hacigaga suwa, zwama bware bu huge aco ni zwamaga ana Yuhana i hargagu, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />acyage aco hinda a hyen ani Iliya ibi ya sire, hinda acyage aco a hyen ana ciki u aco acubagu Hwinsu ana asanu abiya amaringe. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ama Hiridus i hin, &lt;&lt;Gyamui na gunji icwa Yohana. gamba, biniya buna bu gya niyiwa ni huge cikarigo ci buba?&gt;&gt; kwa buba ni ccimgagi bu hyan Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i ryagacume aco dubu ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Inga silmajiri siba sa gi, kwa siba na zwama Yesu ina siba iyi. Kwa Yesu na ala ni silmajiri hind kwa silmajiri ni burya̠ siba ni ugo hya ini yaba ni uge Betsaida, <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />ama aco dinyiya nga̠ aba huge kuruwa bware kwa aba ni lagana bware. Inga bware bu sanag hinda bware bu eagy ga cikarigo ci cigwama ci Hwinsu, hinda kwa bware ni hwingacuma aco na aza mahuna.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Nu kuruwa u yumbe kwa silmajiri kope na sirya si kure pa bware kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Zwamana aco aliyi suwa ui e'ogo zwama a hyin mare mana maba ire ni huga malabo zwama ci yiwa ni hilo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Kwa Yesu na cane, &lt;&lt;Panijiga mare a re.&gt;&gt; Kwa aba ni cane bware, &lt;&lt;Ciza burodi uta na murege murya-kwa di ci ise ni suwa io'go ci sanya mare zwama apa aco ni matanaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(aco ni matanaga a wuci aco dubu taco.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Hinda Kwa bware ni hyen ni silmajiri si buba, &lt;&lt;Zwamanija aco amadale kupeta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Kwa silmajiri ni eag nga̠ Yesu bu zwamas, hinda kwa tugamba ni madala. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Inga Yesu iba ce burodi uta ni murege murya kwa bware ni byana zata zaro, kwa bware ni goji Hwinsu kwa ni bubusag. Kwa bware ni pan silmajiri si bware si pa aco.<verse eid="LUK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Aco ni matanaga re kamu tigab bu sigi, kwa silmajiri ni tangaga mare mana ma gane mutasu ikope ni murya ma gane.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a yaje Yesu i sa Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Aza huna Yesu iba na ahunda ibeba hinda silmajiri si bware siba tare ni bware, bware bu kabasa, &lt;&lt;Biya aco upug aba yiwa ni zwamaga ana gya nisa <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Kwa aba ni cani bware, &lt;&lt;Acyagiya aco hyen gabuya busa Yuhana i baptisma; cyagiya aco hinda Iliya; cyagiya aco hinda acubago buna bu kwaji bu marigya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />&lt;&lt;Yesu i kaba ga ama ganhi pa?&gt;&gt; bware bu kaba. &lt;&lt;I hyen ani nisa gamba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Bitrus a cane, &lt;&lt;Kristi bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu a hyen naba ata zwamana ko na bucohya. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesu i hyen, &lt;&lt;Bwa bu buwuma bui so wahala u iyi dinyiya hinda a'unga i wonje bware, alabe labe na hawalami, hinda i huni bware huntacula bui masinga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Kwa Yesu ni hin silmajiri buba ka̠mu: &lt;&lt;Duk buna bui gimba na lagan, bu wanje icwa buba bui su wahala dinyiya bui na laga. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />buna bu kari caga a̱huru a buba bui nagi iya, hinda buna bu nagi icwa buba bui hyan bui hyan yaba zaro. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Unba laco buco bu hin iyi doone ni kamu, hinda bu nagi icwa buba? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ka̠mu buna bu hoge muiya amumui na cikarigo acumui ni doone, bwa bu buwama bui hugi muiya mububa huna buba bui maringe ni cugwama ci buba na cigwama ci buca buba na acuma a nagu ciri a Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Kamahinda na zwama, aza aco na yiwa pini an aza ikwaji kwa a hyan cigwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">U biciko u kamani a Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Nga̠ muhun tataco Yesu aba hogi cikarigo cini, bware bu zangi Bitrus, na Yuhana, na Yakub kurwa i'ogo zwama bware iyi ahunda. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Yesu iba na ahunda, kwa sunu bware na mabicika, hazunga ha bware kwa ni cine nga̠ malanga ma ula. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Aco barya, Musa na Iliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />kwa ni silta bware na cilabe aba na cikarigo ni Yesu nga̠ bware buba bui sinji nufi a Hwinsu na ikwaju i bware ni Urshalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Bitrus na silmajiri sirya aba na malabo, nga̠ aba a harigi, a hin cilabe ci Yesu na aco barya yisinga na bware. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Nga̠ aco ni aba kari curya Yesu, Bitrus a hyan ni bware, &lt;&lt;Buca bu yaba, u iyi gam nga̠ gaci kurya piniya. Ga ci egyi hazaka hataco- uzaka uika u Nubu, uika u Musa hinda uika u Iliya.&gt;&gt; (Bitrus bwe dakuwo ina bware buba yiwa kargyaga.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Nga̠ Bitrus aba yiwa na cikarigo, kwa halal ni silta Yesu kwa ni kubtan bware, kwa aba na hoge iwasa nga̠ aba ise halal. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Kwa cikarigo ni sire ni suwa ulal, kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Buna busa bwa bu mui, buna bu gya na zabi; i kubla bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Nga̠ bicaro biba hogi cikarigo kwa aba ni bangi yesu ababa. silmajiri si ma ilana ni suwa wab, ai zwamanu bucohya ini<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume bulagasa na mupyala mu wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Nga̠ ubungwa buwa bunge, Yesu na silmajiri si bware nga̠ aba a kazingi ni i'ogo, aco upugo a kure pa bware. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Kwa bucahya na uga bware ni koce, &lt;&lt;Walami, Zwama Hwinsu byana bwa bumui zwama bube busa bwa bumui buika. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Kwa mupyala mu wo ni san bwa busa ci'ogo; kwa ni kwamanibo ni cinge hal bu iyi ingana bu mate hatanbi nga̠ hapucoco ni sire ni unu buba. Mui curya bobwa mabuna hinda nga̠ mu ka̠ri huneba. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ni gami silmajiri asibwe na Hwinsu ana a ace mupyala mu wo, ama amayage.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />&lt;Yesu i cane, aco nagu u itano soo hinda aco magwata̠,&gt;&gt; Yesu i cyani, &lt;&lt;Ka̠mu isanu ini gya ni sanu ni ga̱hi hinda udalu nimui ni ga̱hi? Kulya bwa bubui apini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Bwa buba na kurwo pa Yesu, kwa mupyala mu eewo ni kwaman bwa ni cinge hal bu mate. kwa Yesu ni butan mupyala mu eewo kwa ni hwingacuma bwa kwa ni cutan buca bu buba. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Aco ka̠mu hoge mamaki ni ini Hwinsu uba iyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ha suwa haba mabicikaga nga̠ aba hyan ini Yesu iba iyi, kwa bware ni hyen ni silmajiri si buba, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />&lt;&lt;Kublaji ini gya ni kari ni zwaman: Bwa bu buwama bu kari kure ihuga ina aba ai cutana bwa ni wa aco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ama silmajiri si dakuwo ina Yesu iba yiwa na zwamaga. Zwama asuingega, zwama ata kumbagya, hinda a huge wasa i kaban bware cikarigo cini.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gamba bwe sana bulabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Silmaji si Yesu si hina masinsa ana gamba bwe sana bulabe. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu, nga̠ iba daki ina abayiwa na mazwamana, kwa bware ni zangi bwa bu nuya hinda kwa ni iri bwa bu yisa pa bware. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Kwa Yesu na hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Kanmu buna bu ciye bwa buna ni ize nimu buni ciye; hinda buna buni ciye buna ciye buna bwa ni cuma. Buna busa icwa buba busi bunuya ni gahi- bubiya busi bulabe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />&lt;&lt;Buca bu yaba,&gt;&gt; Yohana i hyen, &lt;&lt;Ci hyan bucahya na ance mupyala mu wo ni ize nibuya hinda hal ci ka̱ri gazgana bo, zwama buza tare na gaci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />&lt;&lt;Yesu i canega tare na silmajiri si mewa Ta gazgana ga,&gt;&gt; Yesu i hin, &lt;&lt;Kanmu buna buza gaba ni ga̠ci busa abuhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hasamariyawa ha hila hya ha yajuwa ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Inga lokaci uba yabta aba i zangi Yesu kuro zaro, kwa bware ni hinana cihana kuro Urshalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Bware bu cuma bu cuma bu sangi bware ni kuro, kwa buba ni ala hila a Samariyawa zwama bu kimga tibya kamin bware kurya; <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ama aco hwayi a wonje yaje na bware zwama a hyan bware bupa sinu kuro Urshalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Inga silmajiri si Yesu Yakub n Yohana aba hyan, kwa aba ni kaban, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone, bugimba gacu ugana ula ni zaro u kanzigya u hunega?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Kwa Yesu a byaniga kwa ni butaniga, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />kwa Yesu na silmajiri si bware na ni kure hila amayiwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ini i hyan aco ni lagana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Aba na cihano ni yina, kwa bucyahya ni hyen ni Yesu, &lt;&lt;Nibu lagana tuhumba goo bu ka̱ri kure.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu a cyane, &lt;&lt;Siwa si hila siza habanda hinda muwono mu zaro muza cihogo ama bwa bu buwama buza ihugo buba bui labta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Kwa Yesu ni hyen ni buciyahya, &lt;&lt;Ni laganya&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Kwa buba ni cyani bware, &lt;&lt;Bugwam bu duniya, Yisan ni kure rwagi wumban buca abumui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu a hyen na buba, &lt;&lt;Curya aco ni i tanuwa suwa ama wumba, ama goo ala cubage cikarigo ci cigwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Kwa bucyage ni jidani hin, &lt;&lt;Nibu lagan Bugwama bu doone; ama curya gya kure sipiya aco nimui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Aza buna bu yiwa ni cuma ni ukwange una bu byane kacuta buza ise cigwama ci Hwinsu zaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a cuma silmajiri kupe tandara na sirya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ka̠mu ni harbuni Yesu i cuma silmajiri kupe tandarya ni sirya igupe cuman silmajiri sirya si ri gaba kuro mu'ogo muna mu bware bwe kure. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yesu i zwamag, &lt;&lt;Gubo u muse ama aco ibwana ayiwa cimu. Kabanije e Bugwama bu guba zwam bu cumana aco ibwana kuro ita u guba. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Baniya Alaji! Na yiwa na cumana nga̠ hatamai ni suwa u mukwacukwacu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Ita zanga ipamo ko irijapu ko hataka; ita brya ni yina zwama ibungo ya aco.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />&lt;&lt;Si i ise yaba, i rwage hin, &lt; Hwinsu u tane yabana uno u burya̠ .&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Si buco burya̠ buyiwa, iyi burya̠ nibwe i bangya si sa harbuni, iyi burya̠ nibuya i maringya ahwabwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Yisaniji ni yaba, ganhi ni re ni sho ini aba pan, zwama aco ibwana u gyamace acupega. ita hinana ni ringe mu yaba.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />&lt;&lt;Si ise ni i'ogo hinda ai ce, ire kanmu ina aba ai kulage. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />I hwingacume aco mahuna ana iyiwa ni zwamag, &lt;&lt;Cigwama ci Hwinsu ci yabta ni gahi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ama si i ise ni i'ogo ai yajuwa ni ganhi, ikure ni yina i hyan, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />&lt;Ko buyala i'ogo ni una uyiwa ni buna nihi ui eag sheda nagu u yaji nihi. Ama idaki: Cigwama ci Hwinsu ci yabtana.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ni zwama, Ina aba egyi ni sodom wui zaki ni yama ni ini aba i eagya i'ogo nihi.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />&lt;&lt;Yama nihi,Korasin! yama nihi Betsaida! Zwama, ibwana i burya̠ naba ia̠g ni Taya ni Sidon, si magwata̱ maba tuntuni, idalagu ni hazuzu ni isubtagu mucwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Hona waba ui ia̠ga shara'a i zaki hugi yama i Taya ni Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Aco, Kaparnahum, ibu ugana ai pan cilabe kuro zaro? Aye, iba kazga hal kuro ihuga i dala aco na kwajo.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />&lt;&lt;Yesu i hin na silmajiri; Ka̠mu buna kubli, buna bwe wonje gyamui; hinda buna buni wanji bu wanji buna buni cuma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Silmajiri kupe tandara a maringiya ni wa̱wo kwa aba ni hin, &lt;&lt;Bugwam bu duniya, hal na mupyala mu uwo muci pa cilabe ni ize nebu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Ni hyan buca bu wo bu hine nga̠ ula zata na zaro. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Ni pa koce i punjige sihwa na sina na pa koce pa aco na wonje; ihya za ni hyan ko cumi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Hinda ita eag wawo zwama sihuru si kuza ciyi, ama ea wawo ni muziya amuhi arubuci ni zaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Hun buni Yesu, sunji ni wawo zwama a̠huru a burya̠ ayiwa tare ni bware, bware bu hin, &lt;&lt;Nabu pan cilabe buca abumui bugwama bu zaro ni doone, zwama bu suyi zwama una pa aco mahasa ni hawalami, kwa goo ni ciba ina pa sawu sinu. Harbuni, Buca abumui, zwama ubiya u iyi gama ni goo.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />&lt;&lt;Iyi ka̠mu buca abumui buni pan. Ko ni buni bu daki bwa ko buco, hinda ko ni buna bu daki buca kwa buna bu bwa buba ka̱ri bu daki.&gt;&gt; ama bwa bu aco daki buco pa buba.<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />kwa Yesu na mabicika pa silmajiri si bware ni cisui, &lt;&lt;Unu burya̠ usa wu acona hyan ini gahi hyan. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ni zwama acubagu Hwinsu dinyiya ni mugwamgwam agimbagi si hyan ina gahi hyan ama a hyanuwo ahuge ina gahi huge ahuguwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali u Busamariya bu burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Aza huna walami ilabe u cibago cikarigo ci Musa ni masinge u gwaji Yesu. &lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; u kaba, &lt;&lt;Biya gya ni ia̠ga zwama gya hin a̠huru ana aza ihogu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Ibiya Musa uba rubuci?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Niya goo bu karance?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Bware bu cyane: &lt;&lt; &lt;Ka̱ri bugwama bu doone Hwinsu nibui ka̱mu ni suwa nabu ka̱mu ni a̱huru nibui ka̱mu ni koce nabu ka̱mu ni soo nibui;&gt; hinda kalo tigamba nga̱ icwa nibwe.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />&lt;&lt;Bu cane na burya̠,&gt;&gt; Yesu cane. ea haruni buza kwaji.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Walami u ka̱ri ciba nga̠ uza laifi, kwa waba ni kaban yesu, &lt;&lt;Gamba gya ni cibag maka̠la̠?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu a cyane bo: &lt;&lt;Buca hya bu sire Urshalima bu ka̱ri kuri Yeriko, Kwa ahya ni tarba. kwa aba ni cyaga bware icwana i bware ka̱mu, a iyami bware a iyami bware ni huna kwa ni mawalano, a curya bware nga̠ bu kwajo. Bulabe bu laga yinani, nga̱ buba hya buco buni, kwa buba ni burya̠ ni mawalana. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Bulabe bu laga ni yina uni, kwa ni bangi buwama ni yina kwa ni burya̠ kwa ni curya bware bu labci ni yina. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Hinda bucyage buwama buna bwa sire ni azwaga u lawi, kwa buba ni bangi bwa, kwa ni mawalani. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ama Basamariye buna buyiwa ni cihana bu bangi buwa kwa ni labci, kwa ni kure ihuga ina iba labuce; nga̱ buba hyan bware kwa aba ni hugi yama buba. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Bu kure pa bware kwa ni palaga ucumi, kwa ni sokotaga manube. Kwa bware ni zangi buba ni aziyaki a bware kwa buba ni kula bwa ni masauki ni ea kula ni buba. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Nga̱ ubungwa uba wa bunge kwa buba ni zangi musare kwa ni pan buco hugu imalabo bu byanga bwa. &lt;Byangana bware,&gt;&gt; bwa hyan &lt;Si ni maringe ni bu cupe ka̱mu ina goo bu huni.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />&lt;&lt;Yesu i kaba, aco bataco ganba buna bu cibe an busa buco buna bu yabuta na buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ana daki utakada u Musa a cyane, &lt;&lt;Buna bu hoge yama bware.&gt;&gt; Yesu a zwama bware, &lt;&lt;Kuli iyi nga̱ buba bu iyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni yaba Imarta ni Imaryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu na silmajiri si bware aba ni ala, bware bu wuci hilla pa ihugo ina bu'a hya aba ugo Imaryamu gujigage bware yaba. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Izi buhun buna aba ugo Maryamu, i madaliye na buna Yesu iba ni hugaga ina Yesu aba ni cibaga <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ama Imarta iyiwa na egu ibwana ina i zangi hankali waiba. kwa iba ni kure pa bware kwa ni kaban, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone bui hyanuwo buhun abumui buni curigagi ibwana? Zwaman bo kurya buna banga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />&lt;&lt;Imarta, Imarta, kwa Bugwama bu doone bu cane, &lt;&lt;Bai san suwa nubuya uba hacigage zwama iyi doone, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />ama iyi bika goo bu gimbo. Ama Imaryamu i tanga inasa i burya̠, hinda aza icyaga iya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu i cibage nga̠ aba ai ea anhunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Aza hona Yesu iba ni ea anhunda na ihugo hya. Inga bware buba hogi, kwa almajiri abware na kaban bware, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone, ci cibe nga̠ gaci ci eago anhunda, nga̠ Yohana iba cibage silmajiri siba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Si bu ginbo ia̱ a̱hunda, zwamaga harbuna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;&lt; &lt;Buca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">a pa iziya nibui cilabe nebo na burya̠,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">cigwama acibui ci kurya,<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />ci pan mare ma nawuya na ma tohonba.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Ci curigagi magwata̱ amaciyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">nga̱ gaci cisa curigagi aco na ci ia̱gi magwata̱</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">. Ci kumugage ta ci curya ci hene sa ci gwaji.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />kwa Yesu na hin nab, &lt;&lt;A hyansi aza buna buza a'osa, kwa buba na kore na usa u gita kwa na hin, &lt;A'osa, na panya utase burodi utaco <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />zwama a'osa namu ana gi cihano a laga a hwamui, hinda na za ehya i gya na pan an.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />&lt;&lt;Buna buyiwa na shuwa kwa na cane, &lt;Tama dama. Zwama na rigyano na gudano i'iba, hinda saawo asimuyo siyiwa tare na siba. Naza ipwana na masingabu pan ihya.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Na izwama, kobuza ipan bwa burodi zwama buba sa aosa a buba, kwa di zwamanagu we iwasa i buba bwe masinga bu pan bwa nga̠ bu ginbago.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Na zwama: Kaban ai bu pan; ginbag bui hya; kobutan i'iba ai bu gunjigage. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kanmu buna bu yiwa ne ginbo bwe hya; buna bu ginbago bu hyan; buna bu kwabta, i'iba ai gonjagya bo.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Bonba buca, si bwa bu buba bu kaba bwa irege, bui pan bwa ahwa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />ko hinda a kabo bwa igya, bui pan bwa anaa? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Si ga̠hi, buna isa aco wo, idaki ipan saawo asihin daje iburya̠ , bale Buco abuhin buna bu yiwa na zaro bu pan aco Soo Uburya̠ ana a kabo bware tibe!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Ba'aizabul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Aza hona Yesu iba ne silacume bebe u mupyala mu eewo. Inga mupyala muba sire, kwa buco mahona ne kargyane, aco na matanago a hoge mamake. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ama kwa cagiya aco na hin, &lt;Buba &lt;Ai na koce i Ba'alzabul, bugwama bu siljanu buba ance siljanu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Acage aco a gwaji Yesu kwa ne kaban an bu cibe ga alama ana bu serya pa Hwinsu.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesu i daki shuwa wab kwa na kaban ga; &lt;&lt;Ka̱mu cigwama na i habsage iza sana, hinda yaba na ma habsage iza yinsana i hene. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Si shaitan i ma habsage cigwama, i yisana neya? Ina san gya ni zwame haruni zwama ga̠hi in hya na ance mupyala mu eewo na iziya Ba'alzabul. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Si na yiwa na ance mupyala mu weo na iziya i Ba'alzabul, na iziya i ganba aco nahiyo aba yiwa na ance mupyala mu eewo? Zwama haruni abe ai san silkali a sihin. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ama si niyiwa na ance mupyala mu eewo na koce Hwinsu, harbuni cigwama ci Hwinsu ci kurwa an hwahin.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Si buco bu koce, buza makami dinya, bui a̠pana yaba buba, icwana ibuba iza hoge ihya. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ama si buna bu zake bwa na koce kulta bwa gasa si bu hone bwa, bui hugano icwana i gasa ina buba tane soo u buba neba hinda hugo icwana bu pan aco daje.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Buna bu za tare na gya bui yajuwa na gya, hinda buna buza na tanagan na gya, bwe gatgag.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />&lt;&lt;Si mupyala muwo mu sire na suwa u buco, si mu laga i hug ina iza miya mu ginbage ihuga i ciswin hinda si mui hinwo. Mu hin, &lt;Ne maringya ihugo ina gya na sire.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Hona muba giyo mui bangi yaba ya sacago hinda tihonba ka̠mu kwa gama. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Mu kore mu ginbagya mucage mupyala utandarya muna mu zake mu na suwa u siri, hinda mu ese kwa na madala. Hinda buco bu mahona bui zake nga̠ maba yinsa na jigo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu iba na zwamag haruni, kwa bu'a hya na kargyane na koce, &lt;&lt;Uno u burya̠ usa wa amaci ana abu mace buna bu go bu sho masubo maba,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu cane, &lt;&lt;Uno u burya̠ usa wa aco na hoge cikarigo ci Hwinsu a laga ca.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alama a yunana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Nga̠ aco hinan matanagan, Yesu a hyan, &lt;&lt;Aco zamani u mogonta. A kaba alama i mamaki, ama aza icibaga ihya kwa alama kwa una u yunana. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Nga̠ Yunana ube usa alama pa Nineba, hinda harbuni bwa bu buwama bwe san alama aco zamani. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Isarauniya Ishaba usala u zata i masinga hon hwinsu u hukunci wu aco zamani hinda taniga na ula; zwama i sirya pa cinge cimere dinyiya i kubli mahasa ma Sulemanu, baniya buna bu zaki Sulemanu bubiya abuna. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Aco Nineba ai masinga hon u shara'a aco maguta a ia̠gya ga hukunci; zwama acuri mugota mu waba huna Yunana uba ia̠gya ga wa'azi, baniya buna bu zaki Yunana bu yiwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Picila i ikanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Aza buna bu katiyi picila bu iri uwa ihuga ina aba za hyan, ko imiya i tebur. Kwadi bu jukai uwa zata zwama aco na a kurya i hyan haske <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Haisa ahanhi habe hasa picila a ikanga nuhi. Si haisa ahanhi ha gyamace, ikanga nihi ka̠mu i sinji na haske. Ama sa hasa ha burya̠ , ikanga nihi yi sinji ni ci'incu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Byanije hinda, ula una u yiwa ni ga̠hi ita sana ci'incu. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Zwama harbuni, si ikanga nihi ka̠mu i sinji ni haske, ko ni ihuga inka iza ciincu, i sinji ni haske, sa haske a picila i kata pa ga̠hi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">eewo ucunuhin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Nga̠ Yesu iba hogi cikarigo, Buparise bu uga bware ni yaba buba are mare ni bware; kwa bware ni kure kwa ni madala ni tebur. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Nga̠ Buparise buba bu hyan, Yesu ama guzaguwo wa kafi bware buba re mare, bu sinji ni mamaki.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kwa bugwama bu doone ni hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Baniya hinda, ga̠hi Parisiyawa si guzagi kacuta ka ikopi ni ikwano, ama ni suwa ina sinji kwa cuwo ni muguta. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />ga̠hi aco hataguma! Sa buna bu i ijapu bube bu i suwa ka̠mu? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ama pan ina iyiwa ni suwa ui ihongwa pa aco na za ihya, hinda tibiya ka̠mu ima guzag pa ga̠hi.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />&lt;&lt;Kaito nuhin ga̠hi Haparisiywa, zwama si pa Hwinsu sadaka, zaka u habumba ha iyi sepa na mucyage mubwag ka̠mu. Ama i wunji zwama u burya̠ ni maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu.Ibini ga̠hi kamace i, sa kwa i curi cyagiya ai eaguwo.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />kaito nuhi haparisiyawa, zwama i ka̱ri madalaga ni huga i labe ni muginga mu labe a hina na sangan ni kasuwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />&lt;&lt;Kaito nuhin, zwama i nyaga ni hazinya hana ha yiwa na inta han haza alama, una aco ai dakuwo si punjige ni nagu cidaka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Buna bu daki icibago i Musa dinyiya bu cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami, nga̠ goo bu hin ina kamu, buci cwane hinda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Ga̠in buna bu daki icibago I Musa, kaito nuhi, zwama si icwangiya aco icwana ina aba ai pwanuwa izangi, hinda gahi za idanda ko ibwab inka i cwangiga.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Kaito nuhi, zwama si i gabi acuma Hwinsu hazi, hinda hacici ahahi ana ada habi ha huni ga. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Baniya itani wa iyaji ni ini hacaca ahahi haba iyi; a hune acubago a Hwinsu, hinda ga̠hi igabi hazi haba. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Zwama haruni, Hwinsu ni mahasa muba u hin, &lt;Ni cumagye na acuma a Hwinsu ni silmajiri hinda e hone cage ciki waba hinda acyagiya apniga wahala.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Zwama harbuniya aco zamani une alhaki a mahi ma acuma Hwinsu mana ma aba jigi ni jigu kurwa irwagu i doone, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Ai rwaga pa mahya ma habila na mahya na ihono i zakariya, buna aba hone zata ui ihuga una aba iyagagu Hwinsu sadaka. Harbuni, ni zwama, aco wo na alhaki ai yana na icwa yaba kamu.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Kaito nuhi aco na idaki cikarigo icibagu Musa zwama izangi mabudi ma idaku i. Ga̠hi ni icwa nuhi ya isuwa hinda igazgana aco ni ise.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Nga̠ Yesu iba curi payi, Haparisiyawa na hawalami icibagu i Musa a hina ni wonje cikarigo ci bware kwa na dami bware ni makaban dinyiya, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Aba ni gimba yina una aba ui kumbe bware pa cikarigo ci bware.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Ibutanu zwama malapunci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Inga aco aba matanaga dinya hal aba ni mapundan, Yesu a hina kargyagana silmajiri si bware, bware bu hyen: &lt;&lt;Masikije na icibago i Haparisiyawa, wata manafunci maba. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Aza ina kubta aba za i gunja, ina aba swuyi aza i daki. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ina guwo bu hin na ci'inci i hugi pa hwinsu, ina guwo bu pa kublana ni hacube na suwo ukaba e huge ni zata u isuma u okaba.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Ni zwama, si'osa asimui, ita huga iwasa pa aco ni hune ikanga ai aza ipwanuwa eag ihya. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Na ciba buna bu gahi i hugi iwasa: huga iwasa buna, sibu huna ikanga buzi koce buba bwe kwaman ni suwa ui ula. iya, ni zwama, hugiji iwasa i Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Asa Akukuturu na sule arya? kamu ni haruniya aza buna bu ma nga̠ ni Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Harbuni, cihinji ci icwa nimu arutagica ka̠mu. Ta huga iwasa; izaki muwono ni pa Hwinsu.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />&lt;&lt;Ni zwama, kanmu buna bu zwama aco a yaje ni gya pa aco, bwa bu Buwuma buba ma bwe yaji guwo pa acuma a Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ama buna bwa yajuwa ni gya pa aco buba ma aza yaji ni buba pa acuma Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Hinda tagamba buna bu ia̠ga̠ cikarigo ci mawunda pa bwa bu buwama ai yapya bu ama buna bu ia̠gi a̠huru aburya̠ alala aza yapya bwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />&lt;&lt;Si a kule, na ihuga ina hayahudawa hab matanaganu, mugwamgwam na aco koce, ita madama na ina ga̠hi i zwamaniga, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Na lokaci uni a̠huru a burya̠ i cibaga ina ga̠hi i cane.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali usauna una uzi jukiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Bucyahya ni suwa aco ni hyen bu Yesu &lt;&lt;Walami, zwaman buhun abumui bu hapsage gajo ni gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Boma, gamba bu na tane gya alkali ko gya sana buna bwe hapsaga hazunga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Kwa Yesu ni hyen nab, &lt;&lt;Masikai! i ma shiri zwama kamu eewo; zwamka zani icwana dinyiya iza san ihiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yesu i zwama aco na matanaga kanmu na misali ana: &lt;&lt;Ita buco bu uka̠he izano i dinyiya iza san ina goo buza i panbiro burya̠ . <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />kwa buba ni hya ni icwa i buba, i biya gya ni eag? Ni za ihuga in gya ni iri biro nimu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Yesu ni hin, &lt;ina gya ni eag bina. Ni huzaga kamu si uri asimui gya ima sina si labe, apayi gya ni iri kamu hahi ni icwana. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ni hin ni ico nimui, &lt;&lt;Buza icwana dinyiya ini ibu wuta haya dinyiya. Hupata icwa nibui; ire, iso hugi wawo.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ama Hwinsu i hin ni bware,&gt; goo sauna! nawuya ni gita ni gimba muhunju amabwe. Gamba bwere ina guwo bu ma ilagi icwa nibu?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />&lt;&lt;Ina iyiwa pa buna bu ma'ila ci'iru ama pa Hwinsu bwa iriwa ihya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ita madama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesu a hin ni silmajiri si bware: &lt;&lt;Harbuni ni zwama, ita madama zwama icwa nihi, ina guwo bui re; ko zwama ikanga nuhi, ina gahi imabwadan. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Icwa nihi i zaki mare, ikanga i zaki hazunga. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />I byani muwono: Mu ia̱guwo cikaba ko agubi, aza su uriya ko hakaba; kamu ni haruni Hwinsu u panganuga mare. ama gahi izaki muwono ni daraja! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Gamba ciki nuhi buna cidane bwe jidana awa inka pa icwa ibuba? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Inga gahi iza pwan ia̱g ina cimu, ibe sa ga̱hi madame pa cyagiya ihya?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Byaniji nga̠ pilawa aba si musa. A ia̱guwo ibwana a pyataguwa. kamu ni haruniya, ko ma Sulemanu ni ado a bware a eguwo ado nga̠ ha pilawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Si harbuniya Hwinsu sai bwada humbe hazunga na ubuki, uni uyiwa nawuya, nawuya hinda nu ubunga a kwaman na suwa u ula, bale ga̱hi, aco nagu tani suwa! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Ita tana soo nuhi ni ini ga̱hi i re ni ini ga̱hi i so; ita madama zwama uba. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Zwama aco na aza tani suwa laga ini kamu, zwama bucahya abuhin bu daki ini igimbogo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Gimbagaji cigwama ci Hwinsu, ini kamu ipanagi.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />&lt;&lt;Ita huga iwasa, gahi garke nuya, zwama buco abuhin bu hugi laco bwe pa cigwama cibu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Sangji kamu ina gahi izi kamu ipa aco na za ihya i ia̠gi sicwa asihi ci'iru pa ci buza i unge, ci'iru pa zaro nga̠ ciba za hacigaga, ihuga ini i buhya buza kure cebu hinda haurogo haza ihacigaga. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ihuga goo bu i ci'iru, apace soo nibui uba yiwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hagyama ana amashiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />&lt;&lt;Madaleji ni shiri picila nahi kwa akati, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Inga aco a apa buco bu yaba bu maringiya pa lago cigya, zwama si bu kurya bu kobta i'iba aba gunjigage iba i'iba. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Ui ea gama pa agyama na buci bu yaba bu bangiga ni ape. Kamahinda ni zwama, bui ma bwadan hazunga ipangan imare, bwe zwamaniga madale pa tebur tare naba. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />U ia̠ga gama pa gyama ni buco bu yaba bangiga ni anpe, ko si bu maringe ringuwo u lagi ko tacula apya iya ni gita. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ama daki ina: si buna bu huzi yaba si bu daki lokaci una buhya buba bwe kurya, buza icurya yaba buba buhya ise . <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />gahi ma i mashiri, zwama bwa bu buwama bwe kurya ni tuwamba lokaci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Bitrus a kaba, bugwama bu duniya, buyiwa ni ci zwamgana misali ana, ko pa tigamba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Bugwama bu duniya bu cani, &lt;&lt;Gamba bucyahya busa bugyama butani isuwa ni mahasa, buna bu buci bu yaba buba tanibwa bu cupage agyama musare mu mare daidai ni lokaci? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ui ea gama pa bugyama buna bu buca bu yaba bangi bwa si bu maringgya. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Kamahinda ni zwama, ui tani bwa u iyi kula ni iyi i buba kamu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ama si bugyama bu hin ni suwa u buba, &lt;&lt;Buci bu yaba bu sanu ba maringiya kwa buba ni hinan hunaga byam cware ni una u cwa bu re hinda buba so hal mare ma huniga. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Buco bu yaba bu bugyama bui maringe hu hwinsu una uza samani ni lokaciniya bui dakuwo bui gundaga ga bu tani bwa pa aco na aza itani soo.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />&lt;&lt;Bugyama buna bu daki buca bu yaba buba dinyiya, bo ma iyiwa shiri bwa iyiwo buna bu buco bu yaba bu hin na bugyama bu iyi, ai eame bwe hune ni sigungu dinya. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Buna bu dakuwo ina buco bu yaba buba gimba u gama a iyme bu huna ni agungu cimu. Pa kamu buna aba pan dinyiya, i gama dinyiya pa buba, buna aba pa dinyiya i kaban ga dinyiya.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a kuli u handigagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />&lt;&lt;Ni kule ula ni doone ni cikala acimui a kata unwa! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Niza baptisma ana aba ini ia̠gya hinda ni karo ana ia̠gya una mabuna kwa ni ia̠gi. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />I nga̠ ana ni kurya dala a burya̠ na doone? Aye, ni zwama, kwa rudani. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Daga baniya ui san ni yaba ika aco ta imacobog sicwa saba, bataco i wanji barya i wanji bataco. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ima wundagm, buco bwe wunji bwa hinda bwa bui wunji buco, amaci ai wunji bwa bu cu'a, bwa bu cu'a bwe wanji amaci abuba, Ayinu ai wunji bu'a bu, bu'a bwa bu bwa bwe wanji amaci a bware abuba bob.<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idaku i lokaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu a hin na aco dinyiya: &lt;&lt;Si i hya ulal ni danji kurwa yeme, si i hyan, sila a kari hina.&gt; hinda harbuni. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Si mupyala mu hula ni wa gula, &lt;&lt;I hyan, i ea ubub,&gt;&gt; hinda harbuni. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Gahi malapukai! I pwa i daki yanayi ni cinge ni zaro. niya gahi ya dakuwo yanayi a lokaci?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />&lt;&lt;Besa gahi a eguwa sicwa asihi hukunci ina si gama? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Inga gahi ni ala kuruwa ni kotu, eg kokari ima shiri ni buba ni yina, si bu wanji bwe bu kula ni gaba wu alkali, hal bu tani ni yaba u ci'incu ni zwama, buza i sire kwa bu cupi kamu kobo ni gu buza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Na zwama, buza i sere kwa bu cupe ina aba yiwa nabu lagana<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Curoji eewo ko i kwadagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Baniya ni lokaci uni, aza aco na yanse pani azwama Yesu labari u aco Galili na Bilatus ana a bware bubasa aba hunage ga lokaci ana aba kule sadaka pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu i cyaniga, &lt;&lt;Gahin ugana aco Galili a zake a cagiya aco Galili ni eewo zwama aba suwa wahala ni yina una? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ni zwama, aye! Ama kwa i curi eewo, ga̠hi ma ka̠mu i kwadaga. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ko hinda ikupe na utataco ana kwadagi zwama na Siluwam, ima izaro ya hinaga-gahi yiugana azki cagiya aco na dala na Urshalima? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ni zwama, aye! Kwa i curi eewo, gahima i kwadaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yesu i zwamaga misali: &lt;&lt;Azi bucyahya buza u'on mucu, u kabi na inta u u'on u mucu, bu kure bu byani imata io ni, bwa hiwo koni mata ika. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Kwa Yesu ni hya na buco buna bu eag kula ni mazata ma yaba, &lt;Haya hataco baniya si kurya byani saawo si mucu na sa tabawa i hyan. Gunda uo gipi! Ibe sa uba ni eag ampani ni cinge ni kawai?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Buca̠ bu yaba,&gt; buco bu cyani, &lt;Curya uwa hal i hogu i'uya uika̠, ni igabi pico waba gya hala dwaya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Si u iyi mata uya umayiwa, ui gama! Si wa iwo goo gunji uwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume bugunu hon asabar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />hwinsu u asabar Yesu aba ni cibaga ni suwa ui iginga, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />bu'a hya bugunu bu hal haya kupe na utataco. Bu kuki bwa panuwa ni masinga ni burya̠ . <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Inga Yesu aba hyan iya, kwa ni uga iya, &lt;&lt;Bu'a, aba hwingacuma ni eewo nibui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kwa Yesu ni tani iya wa, wah sanuwo kwa iba ni masiga kwa ni pan Hwinsu cilabe.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Zwama Yesu aba hwingacumi hwinsu u asabar bulabe bu iginga kwa ni hyen na aco, &lt;&lt;Muhun cunihi zwama ci iyi ibwana. A hwingacume aco sa hwinsu asabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu bu cani bware, &lt;&lt;Ga̠hi malapukai! Sa ka̠mu nuhi si pasigiyi inaa nihi ko siziyaki i kule hu mare ko miya hwinsu wa asabar? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Bu'a buna, busa bwa bu Ibrahim, buna buco bu eewo bu pareba hal haya kupe na utataco, aba hwingacume ga hwinsu u asabar?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Nga̠ Yesu bu hin haruni kamu aco ni yiwa ni wanji bware kwa aba ni hugi muiya, ama aco kamu kwa aba ni hugi wawo zwama i burya̠ ini Yesu aba yiwa ni ia̠ga.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali a biro u Mastad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu a kaba, &lt;&lt;Sa Hwinsu u yiwa na cigwama ca aco, ci nyaga neya? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />I nyaga ni biro Mastad, buna buco buba zangi kwa ni kabi ita u buba.U puci kwa ni sani uo, muwono mu iyi cihogu ni habwaba ha uo ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Hinda Yesu akaba, &lt;&lt;Sa Hwinsu u yiwa na cigwama ca aco , ci nyagana neya? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />U nyaga ni yist ana a bua buba hici ni ihungo na muhi dinya kwa muhi kamu ma hici ni yist.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">I iba i nuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu a aliyi na muogo na hila, bware ni cibaga aco bware ni kuro ni Urshalima. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Bucahya bu kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu duniya, aco cimu kawai abe i hya icagago?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu bu cani ba, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Ia̠g kokari ise ni i'iba ini i damani, zwama aco dinyiya nibu zwama, i kari ise ama aza pwana. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Si buhuza bu yaba si bu masinge bu gunda i'iba bui yisan ni jebu ni kwabtagan ni eag roko, &lt;buco bu yaba, ci gunjigage i'iba.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">&lt;&lt;Bware bwe cane, &lt;Na dakuwo hugo ina ga̠hi i kurya.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Hinda i cani, &lt;Ci re hinda ci so tare ni goo, bu cibagi ni yina.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />&lt;&lt;Bware bui cani, &lt;NI dakuwo ihuga ina ga̱hi i sira. Macikiji ahwamui ka̠mu ga̠hi aco ia̱gu eewo!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Cidaro ci yana, ni cihaka ci haila nga̠ ga̱hi i hyan Ibrahim, Ishaku na Yakub ni ka̱mu acubagu Hwinsu ni cigwama ci Hwinsu, ama ga̱hi i kwaman ni jepu. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Aco i kure zata ni kusurwa nasi, amadale a iyi lago ni yaba cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Zwama harbuni aza aco ana a yiwa ni kacuta i san aco jigu ana i sana na jigu i marigya kacutu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a huge yama i Urshalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ni lokaci ani aza Haparisiyawa hana ha kuri pa Yesu kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Curya ihuga ina guwo kure cagiya i huga. Hiridus agimba nibu huni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu a caniga, &lt;&lt;Kulij zwama awa hila, &lt;Ni aci mupyala mu eewo ni hwingacumi aco nawuya nu ubongwa, hwinsu u tacula ni burya̠ nimui.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ka̠mu ni harbuniya ni ri gaba nawuya no ubungwa na kabana ubungwa-zwama kamahinda aza bucuma bu Hwinsu buna bui kwaji ni ijepu i Urshalima!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />&lt;&lt;O'o Urshalima, Urshalima, bui huni bucuma bu Hwinsu tagi bu na hatare buna aba a cuma pa ga̠hi, hal niya gya gimbo ni tanagan saawo asihin ihuga inka nga̠ waruma si tanaga muyawo muiba ni hababo, ama gahi ya karuwo! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Byana, a curi yaba nuhi. Ni zwama, iza na hyanakana kwa i hin, una u burya̠ usa pa buna ba kuri ni ize Buca̠ bu yaba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ni yaba Buparise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Hwinsu u asabar, yesu a kure ri mare ni yaba bucu bu labe bu Aparisiyawa, bware bu eag kula dinyiya. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ni gaba yesu azi bucahya buna buzi mahuna ma amaci. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu mabicikane kwa na kaba Baparise pa icibagu i Musa, &lt;&lt;U iyi gama a hwingacumi buco bu mahuna hwinsu hun asabar?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ama kwa aba ni uwatano. Yesu kwa ni kumbi buco bu mahuna, bware bu hwingacumega kwa ni hyen bu malani.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Kwa bware ni kabanag, &lt;&lt;Azi buna bwa bu buba ko bina bu matane ni ulambu hwinsu asabar, iza zacigya buna ni lambu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Aza ina aba i cyana bware. <verse eid="LUK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Inga Yesu iba hyan alabe ana aba a uga a tanga ihu ina aba madalagi i cilabe na utebur, kwa bware ni zwamanaga misali ana: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />&lt;&lt;Si bucahya bwe uga ni lago cigya, ita zanga ihuga idala icilabe, zwamz i uga buna bwe zaki ni cilabe. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Si harbuni, buna bwa i uga kamu bwe kure na hyan na gahi, &lt;Masinge pa buco buna ihuga idalwo.&gt; hinda, bwe hugi muiya, zangi huga idalwa ina ya gaguwo daraja ni ini i jigu. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Si bu uga na lago, zang idalwo ina yasa ya aco labe zwama si bu huzi bugo si bu kure bu hyen na guwo, &lt;Aboki, masinge kuli pa ihuga idala i gama.&gt; Apaniya aba ibu pana ci labe pa aco na aba uga lago. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kamu buna bu zangi icwa buba zata i kanzigab, buna bu kanziga icwa i buba i zangaca bu zata.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />yesu a zwama buco bu lago, &lt;&lt;Si bu kari uga lago ko iri mare ma hwinsu ko mare ma uyinbe ta ugana si'osa asibwe ko ahun nabwe ko dangi nibu ko aco na zi iyiwa; si bu iyi haruni aba ma ibu uga zwama bu cupe ina guwo bu eagyga. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ama si bu kari ugan lago, ugana aco ni za ihya, agunu, ni aco mahuna ma amaci, arubo, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />hinda unu u burya̠ wi bu lagana. Kamu na harbuni aza ipwana nibu cupa, ibu cupa huna aco burya̠ aba yi masinga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Inga buco bweka buna madale na tebur buba hugi nga̠ kwa buba na hyen na Yesu unu u burya̠ usa pa buco buna bwe re mare pa cigwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu a cyane: &lt;&lt;Azi buco buna bwa uga lago u labe kwa ni ugan aco dinya kurya pa lago. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Na lokaci a lago bu cuma bugyama bu ugana aco a kurya, &lt;kurya, a hogu kimgana tibai.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ama kamu tagamb bu hina ni pana dalili ububa. Buna bu jigu bu hyan, &lt;Bane gya ni sanya ita, ni gimbagu kure hyana uwa. Ni egya hakuri.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />&lt;&lt;Buna bu lagi bu hyen, &lt;Bane gya ni sanya ena a cuma ita, ni gimbago ikure kwaji, na ia̠gi hankuri.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />&lt;&lt;Bucyagi hinda kwa ni hin, &lt;bani gya ni iyi cigya, zwama harbuniya niza i kure.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Kwa bugyama ni maringe ni cubagana buco bu yaba. Kwa bu huzi bu yaba ni dabe suwa kwa ni hyan ni bugyama bu buba, &lt;Ala ni jebu bane ni yina ni suwa ui i'ogo kuliya ana za ihya, ni gunu, ni rubo na za mupyala ma amaci.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Buco bu labe,&gt; bugyama bu hyen,&gt; ina guwo buna cuma ni hogu, ama hal kabaniya ukaba usigane.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Kwa buco bu yaba ni hyen na bugyama, &lt;Ala ni ijupu ni ujubu ni i'ogo zwamanaga kamu a kurya zwama yabani mu sinji. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ni zwama ko buco bweka buna aba a uga ni jigu bwe re mare ma lago numuiyo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ina i hyan Almajiri a Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Aco dinyiya aba ni lagan Yesu, kwa bware bu byanega kwa ni hyan: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />&lt;&lt;Si bucahya bu kurya ahwamui si bwa wunjuwa buci bu buba na amaci abuba bua na saawo si buba, na ahun buba na hun cua-harbuni, kamu icwa ibuba-bwa jubuwa isana almajiri namui. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Hinda tagamba bwa panuwa iso wahala zwama gya buza pwana isana almajiri nimui.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Siza buna bu ginbagu ima yaba zaro. Buza ni madala bu rutage ina buba za si buza musare dinyiya muna buba bwe hoga yaba niya? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Si bu rwage ima bwa panuwa ihogu yabaniya, kamu buna bu hyan bui same bwa, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Yesu na cikarigo, &lt;Buco buna bu rwagi ima ama boi pwanuwa ihoga.<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Ko hinda bugwama bu ginbo kurwo gasa pa bucage bugwama. Buza na madala bu byane si bwe pwana na hasoja dubu kupe nasi si bwe pwana ibana buna buza dubu kope harya? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Si buza ipwan bwe cumana bucuma zwama bu gimbage dala a burya̠ . <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Harbuni hinda ciki nahi buna pwanuwa icurya ina buba za na doone una buza pwana sana almajiri namuiyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />&lt;&lt;Manje ma lacume pa cinge, si lacu maba u hacigage niya maba mai sanakana manje hinda? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Uza gama pa cinge ko dwaya; kwadi a jigi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">&lt;&lt;Buna buza hacube hai hugagu, bwa huge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Misali bitami bina bi inage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Baniya aco icagu iganju na &lt;&lt;aco eewo&gt;&gt; ama dala zwama hoge icibago i yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ama Haparisiyawa na hawalami hana icibago i Musa a hyen &lt;&lt;Buco buna bu ciye aco eewo hinda bu re mare naba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yesu a zwamaga misali: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />Si ciki nahi aza buna bu za hatamai dari uika bitami binka bi inage. Buza icurya kupe-tanasi na utanasi na hila bu kure gimbo bina bi inage kwa bu hya bya? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Si bu hyan bya bwe zangi bya na wawo bu jukani bya na ucucu <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />bu gyi ni yaba. Uba ugana a'usa a buba na ina yiwa ciyaba ni buba tare buba hyan, &lt;Na bangaji wawo; ni hyano bitamiya bim bina bi inagi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ni zwama harbuni hinda wa̱wo ui yana ni zaro pa buco buika buna bu curi eewo zata ni kupe tanasi aco burya̠ ana a gimbagwa acuri eewo.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali musare muna mu inagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />&lt;&lt;Ko hinda bua buza pam ikupe kwa buba ni gipi pam ika. buze kata picila, busacigi yaba bu gimbagi na burya̠ kwa bu tanga pam uniya? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Si bu hyani pam uni bwe uga siboki ni uni madale ciyabu na buba a kurya kamu a hin, &lt;Eji wawo ni gya; ni hyanu pam namu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Harbuni hinda, ni zwama wa̱wo u yiwa pa acuma Hwinsu pa buco bu eewo buika buna bu curi eewo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali u bwa buna bu inagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu u re gaba: &lt;&lt;Aza buco buna buza saawo sirya. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Buna bu nuya bu hin na buci bu buba, buco abumu, ni panya gado nimu.&gt; Kwa bware ni pani bware gado u buba. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Wa sanuwo, bwa bu nuya bu zangi ina buba buzi kamu, kwa ni malan cihana mire ni yaba kwa ni hinana i huni ina aba pa bware. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Inga buba hogi huni ina bubazi kamu, imirwa kwa ni ise ni ugoni buba yiwa, kwa buba ni uni busa bugyama zwama buba re mare. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Bu kure kwa ni hyan ibwana pa bucahya ni ugoni, kwa abu ni pani bwa bu iyi hubo silade. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Bu hina nire mare mana aba pangana silade, ama ko ni buna bu pana bware ihya.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />&lt;&lt;Inga hankali a bware a maringya, kwa buba ni hyen, &lt;Agyama bamba buca abumui buba za acuryagu mare, gyamuyabuna ni karo ni makwadan! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ni maringya pa buci abumui i hyen na buba: Buca abumui, ni iyu eewo pa zaro na guwo hinda. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Na jubuwa ani uga bwa bubo; ni zangi nga̠ gyama nabu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Bu masige kwa ni kure hu buci buba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">&lt;&lt;Kwa busi mire, buca bu buba kwa ni biskeba kwa ni hugi yama bu buba; kwa buba ni iyamani munda pa bwa bu buba, kwa ni makyabu kwa ni cibagu maka̠la̠.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />&lt;&lt;Kwa bwa ni hyen na buba buca buba, &lt;Buca abumui ni iyi eewo na zaro na guwo hinda. Na iwo gama gya saka bwa bubo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />&lt;&lt;Ama buca buba bu hyen na agyama, &lt;&lt;Kuliji ni mabuna! Kuliyaji hazunga ha burya̠ i bwada bware. Tanaji bware imakimaki ni ibwabo i bware hataka na buna bware. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />I kumbya bina bi idage i bacigeb. Ci re mare ci iyi wawo. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Zwama bwa bu mui bo kwaju ama bu harigo baniya; Bwa inage ama ni hyanabu baniy. &lt;A hina ni eag lago.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />&lt;&lt;Ni lokaci buni, bwa buba bu labe bu yansi ni hubo nga̠ buba bwa yabtan ni yaba bu huge iyama na cihibo. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kwa buba ni ugana bugyam bweka kwa ni kabanab abegya pare. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />&lt;Buhun abubwe, bu maringuwa,&gt; bu cyani bware, &lt;Buci abubo bu bacige bina bi idage zwama bu hinwa bware bane.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buhun bu labe ni dabe suwa bu wanje ise ni yaba. Kwa buci bu buba ni kure ni walganab. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Bu cyani buco bu buba, &lt;Byana! Ka̠mu haya hana ni yiwa ni ia̠ ibwana pa goo nga̠ bugyama nasa tabuwa goci cikariguwo acibui. basa tabuwa na pana ko binya bi nuya bale gya eag lago na siboki asimui. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ama buna bwa buba buna bu hacigagi iyi wa nabu bu giyi, bu hunibu bina bu idage!<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />&lt;&lt;Bwa bumuya,&gt; buci bu hin na buba, &lt;Buyiwa tare ni gya taamba lokaci ina gya niza kamu isa nabu. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ama dole gacu iyi lago ni wawo, zwama buhunwo abubo bwa kwaju ama bu hargaga; bwa inagi ama ci hyano ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Misali Bugyam buna buza Cibya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu a zwama silmajiri si bware: &lt;&lt;Azi buco buna buza jukiya dinya kwa buba na tana wakili una u hina ni hacigag jukiya u buco bu juki. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Kwa buco bu juki uga wakili hon uyi kwa na kaban, bai gya ni yiwa ni huge aba yiwa na zwamag an go bu yi? Na ginbo go yi lisapi oi bwana ni boi, zwama na kanruwo go ibwana ina i gya na bu pa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />&lt;&lt;Kwa wakili na mazwan na shuwa uba, &lt;Bai gya na eaga baniya? Buca bu yaba abumoi bu kari na caga ibwana ni mui. Hinda nazawa koce oi ibwana, hinda ni yiwa na huge mu'ean mu gya eag una- <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Na daki ina gya na eaga,sa na ance pa ibwana nga̠ aco ai yaje na gya na yaba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />&lt;&lt;Kwa bware na uga aco na buca bu yaba buba yiwa na lagan utase. Bu rwage kaban buco bu jigo, &lt;Mubanba buca bu yaba buba yiwa na bu lagan?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Ha galan ha manube dari utataco,&gt; bu cane. &lt;&lt;Wakili u zwama bwa, &lt;Zanga utakada nebuya, mahaguza ma madale,hinda hinlaga kope taa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buba na kaban buco bulagi, &lt;Go hinda mubanba aba yiwa na bulagan?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt; &lt;Hariza ha alkama dubu uika,&gt; bu cane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;Kwa iba ni zwaman ean, &lt;zanga utakad go jidane dari utataco.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />&lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba bu yabane buco buna bu ia̱gi bwa cibya zwama mahasa mana ma buba cibe. zwama aco zamani abiya pwa na aco zamani unena aco na yiwa na lagana Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Ni zwama, eag ampani ni dukiya nibui zwama a hyin sio'sa, zwama si bu hogi tibai, aco za nibu suma hinda bwe hyan yaba dala ana aza ihogu.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />&lt;&lt;Kamu buna bwaba yaje na buba na i cimu e yaje ni buba ni iyi dinyiya, hinda buna bwa bui yajiwa na buba ni iyi cimu hinda aza yaje na buba na iyi dinyiya. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Si bwe iyiwo kamahinda na i kumgagu i icwana i doone, aza buna bui yaji na goo si bui hinwo dukiya u gaskiya? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Hinda si bwe si tabuwa kumgaga icwana i bucohya, gamba bwe pan icwana i buba?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />&lt;&lt;Aza bugyama buna bui pana aco yaba barya cilabe. Ko bu ka̱ri buika bu wonje bu cyage, ko hinda bu pa icwa i buba ka̱mu pa buika hinda bu wonje ipan icwa pa bu cagiye. bu za i pana Hwinsu cilabe ni musarya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Haparisiyawa, hana hakari musare, a hugi kamu cikarigo cini ci Yesu kwa habi ni dabi soo. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Kwa bware ni hyin naba, &lt;&lt;Ga̠hiya i zangaci sicwa asihi pa hisa aco, ama Hwinsu i daki hasoo ahahi. Ina aco aba pa daraja ibiya isa i ciri pa hisa Hwinsu.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i jidane icibaga aco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Icibagu Imusa na Acibago Hwinsu abiya aco hinan ni lagan hal hun Yuhana u Baptisma. Tun lokaci uniyo, cikarigo ciburya̠ ci Hwinsu cibai cigwama cibage, hinda tigamba bu hina ni gimbo u iso. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ka̱mu ni haruni ui zaki zaro ni cinge ci wuni na hya cikarigo ci icibago Imusa ci yali.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />&lt;&lt;Buna bu anci bu'a bu buba pa buba zi buna bu yiwa ni ia̱ cidan, hinda buco bu cware buna bu zi bua buna bwabu aci buba ma bu yiwa ci ia̱ cidan.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buco bu dukiya ni Liazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />&lt;&lt;Yesu hin an a iyi bucahya buna buzi dukiya dinyiya busa bu mabwada hazunga ha musarya dinyiya hinda i huga i malabo ma buba ise i musarya. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ni i iba iso yaba buba azi buco bu una ize i buba Li'azaru, ikanga i buba ka̱mu iza hahuga <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />tun humba busa bu kurya bu madale ciyabu buco bu musare bu yiwa ni re mare. Sewa sisa si kurya siba ni lanje hahugo ha buba.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />&lt;&lt;Lokaci u kure kwa buco bu musare na ni kwaji hinda kwa acuma Hwinsu ni zangi bwa kwa ni kula bwa ciyabu Bucibagu Hwinsu Ibrahim. Kwa buco bu jukiya hinda ni kwaji hinda a wumbo iya. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ni yaba ula, buco bu dukiya bu ise wahala dinyiya, kwa buba ni danda hisa zata hinda kwa ni hya Ibrahim ahwayo cimire, aba tare ni Li'azaru ciyabu ni bware. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Kwa buco bu jukiya ni ugan bware, &lt;Buca abumui Ibrahim, huga yama nimui cumana Liazaru a tane ibwab yaba ni miya adulocumi a̱re nimui, zwama niyiwa ni hugi sungoro ula dinyiya.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Ibrahim ni hin, &lt;Bwa, ma butiryagya nga̱ buba yase ni doone bu yasa ni hya iyi burya̠, ama Liazaru aba ni hyan ini i gyamacuwa, baniya bware bu yiwa ni hugi laco hinda bu buyiwa ni hugi sungoro. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Banni haruni ma, sakani nuci ni goo azi ulambu u labe una u yiwa sakani nuci ni goo, zwama aco ina gimba kure ahwaci aza pwa, ko hinda buna bu gimbu i kaca kuro ahwaci.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buco bu musarya ni cyani, &lt;Zwama Hwinsu niyiwa nibu una, buco abumui, cumani Li'azaru pa buco abumui, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Zwama niza a̱hunwo ta. Bu kure bu numiga hacube, zwama ata kurya ihugo ina gya niyiwa nisu wahala.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />&lt;&lt;Ibrahim a cyani, &lt;Azi Musa na acubago Hwinsu; ahuge ga.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Aye, buco abumui Ibrahim,&gt; bware bu hin, &lt;Ama si buco bu kwaju bu maringe paba, i curya eewo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Ibrahim ni hin ni buba, &lt;Si e huguwa Musa na acubago Hwinsu, aza iyaje ko buco bu kwajo bu kure paba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Magwata na iyapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu i hyen ni silmajiri siba: &lt;&lt;Ina i sana aco i magwata̱ i kure, ama unu taikaci u kumbo buna busa dalili. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />I zakan apareb ni utare cinama ni bicwaro bu buba aba kwama bu ni suwo uwo so buba bwe sana cikin saawo sina si iyi magwat. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Masikai ni icwa nibwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">&lt;&lt;Si buhun abubo buba egyi magwata̱, butana bwa, hinda si bu curi,yapya bwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Hinda si buba egyi magwat hal utandarya ni ihun inka, hinda si bu kurya ahubwe hal kuro tandarya bu hyan, &lt;Ni curo eewo,&gt; curobwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Kwa silmajiri bu hyen na Bugwama bu duniya, &lt;&lt;Ci jidani itani isuwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Kwa yesu ni cyani, &lt;&lt;Si izi itani isuwa ini igagi ni bibiro bitamba, bwe zwaman uo labe, &lt;Mamuci hinda mabire ni uwo,&gt; Hinda i eag nga̠ buba hyen.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />&lt;&lt;Si izi buco buna buzi bugyama buna buyiwa ni hubo i hatamui. Bui zwamana bugyama si bu giyi ni ita, &lt;Kurya bane madale ere mare&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Buza ihya, &lt;Ni egyi mare ma yumbe hinda ma shiri ni apgage gya ire hinda eso; kamu ni haruniya bu re hinda eso&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Bui gojo bugyama zwama buba i ina aba hya ana uba iyi? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Gahi ma harbuni, si i iyi ina aba hyen ana gahi iyi kamu ui hya, &lt;Gaci ci sa gyama ijubuwo ihya; ci iwo ina i kamaci ina kamaci iyi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">A hwingacume hakuturu ikupe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu buba ni kure yina Urshalima, bware bu laga ha yina hana azi uhare na Samariya ni Galili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Inga Yesu uba na ise i'ogo hya aco ikupe ana za mahuna ma cikuturu a kure pa bware. kwa aba ni yisan cimire <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />kwa ni danda bicoro kwa ni uga bware &lt;&lt;Yesu, Buco bu yaba, huga yama nuci!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Inga Yesu buba hyan ga, kwa buba ni hin, &lt;&lt;Alaji, icibe sicwa asihi alabe labe.&gt;&gt; Inga aba ali, kwa mahuna ma ci kuturu ni curyaga.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Buco bweka, nga̠ buba hyan a hwingacumega, kwa buba ni maringya pa Yesu, buba ni sangan ci ogo ni pani Hwinsu cilabe ci buba. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Kwa buba ni makwaman pa buna i Yesu buba ni gojo bware- hinda busa buco bu Samariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu i kaba, &lt;&lt;I hwingacume aco kupe? Aco utandarya ayiwa humba? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />I hinwo buna bu hya gama bu kurya bu pa Hwinsu cilabe kwa unyagata buna?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Kwa Yesu ni hyen na buba, &lt;&lt;Masinge ali; itanu nibuya isuwa ibe ibu hwingacumi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kurwa cigwama ci Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Haparisawa, ha tabe kaban Yesu binba cigwama ci Hwinsu ciba ci kurya, kwa Yesu na cane, &lt;&lt;Ai kurwa cugwama ci Hwinsu aza i hya ni haisa, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />ko hinda aco ai hyan, &lt;Cigwama cini a cina,&gt; ko hinda &lt;Cibe a ciyo,&gt; zwama cigwama ci Hwinsu ciyiwa apanhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Kwa bware na hyan na silmajiri si bware , &lt;&lt;Hon uyiwa na kurwa una u ganhin i ginbag i hyan Bwa bu buma,ama iza hya. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Hinda aco ai hya na ganhin,&lt;Bware abu yiwa!&gt; ko hinda &lt;Bware a buna!&gt; Ita lagana ga i kore. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Inga walkiya uba si i na lokaci uba, harbuni Bwa bu Buwa ma buba boi haske u buba we rwaga pa ugagi u duniya kurwa u cagiya ugagi. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Na jigu bwa bu buwoma ai sungola bware dinyiya aco bware hinda a wonje bo.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />&lt;&lt;Inga uba i hon Nuhu, harbuni uba ui san na hon Bwa bu Buma. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Aco yanse na so, na ere, na eaga cigya hinda na kulag cigya hal hon Nuhu uba u kore u ese jirigi. Hal pongwa u miya u kure kwa na hugan aco kanmu a kwadagi.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />&lt;&lt;Harbuni hinda hon Lutu. Aco na re na sho, sang na sango, aba na cibero eag ima. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ama hon Lutu sere na Saduma, kwa aba na halan ula u Hwinsu na hatare ha la na zaro kwa na hunagga kamu.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />&lt;&lt;Harbuni uba oi san hon na aba ai ciba Bwa bu Buco. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Honi buna bu yiwa zata oi ishuma i yaba buba buta maringya esho yaba an bu ka̱ri izangi icwana ibuba na shuwa u yaba. Harbuni hinda, Buna bu yiwa na enta buta narigya yaba bu zangi ihya. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mabutarya na bua Lutu! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Buna bu kari bu iri a̱huru a buba bui nagi an, hinda buna bu ka̱ri bu inri a̠huru abuba bui hyan an. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Na zwama, na hon niyo aco barya ai yana ni gado; aikan ai zangi buco boika a curi buikan. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Si'a sirya si yana na cinamo; ai zangi buikan a curi bwekan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Aco barya ui san na ita; ai zangi ika a curi inka.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Silmajiri si Yesu si kaba &lt;&lt;Honba, Bugwama bu doone.&gt;&gt; a kaba bware.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Bware bu cane ga, &lt;&lt;Ihugo ina ikanga i'o iba yiwa, hawunku hai matanagan apayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Misali u ahunda pa bu'a buna bware bu kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Hinda Yesu a zwama silmajiri si bware misali zwama i ahunda tuhumba lokaci. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Yesu i hyen: &lt;&lt;Ni i ogo hya a i si alkali hya aza i wasa i Hwinsu bale amadami na aco. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ni suwa i ogo iniya aza bua buna bu bware bu kwaji buna bu hina ni kulagi pa alkali, &lt;Ni pa haki nimu ana aba ani kule kara.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />&lt;&lt;Ni jigu a wanje. Ama ni kacuta bu zwama icwa ibuba , &lt;Ni daki ni za iwasa i Hwinsu hinda nama damuwa na aco, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />kamu ni harunini zwama bua buna bware buba bu kwaji bu hina na dama, ni eag kokari iya ina iba gimbago, zwama iba curi kuro na dama!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Kwa Buca̱ bu yaba ni hin, &lt;&lt;Atana i hugi ina alkali a eewo aba hyan. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Hinda Hwinsu uza huge yama hwa aco ana i hugi iwasa woba ana si hina cidaro gita ni hwinsu? Ui e jinkiri ni tamaku yaba? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ni zwama, wi hyan kwa a hyen ina aba gimba, ni ma buna. Zwama harbuni, si bwa buwama bu kure, bwe bangya in tani isuwa ni doone?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali Bufarisiye na walami ui cagu u ganju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Cyagya aco a hyan sicwa saba ana aza nagu eewo hinda a hya tigamba buza eewo, Yesu u zwamaga misali: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Aco barya a kure ni iginga zwama i ahunda, buco bweka busa bupafarisiye bweka walami ui icagu i ganju. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Bufarise bu masinge bu iyi ahunda zwama icwa ibuba: &lt;Hwinsu, nibu gwajuwo zwama na nyaganuwa na aco-na eag ahya ni na eagagu eewo, na aco si bungago na sia saco-nga̠ walami ui cyagu ui ganju. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ni eagu cui so urya ni mako ni pangano zaka ina gya niza kamu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ama walami ui cyagu ui ganju bu masingai kwa ni ma miryacuma. Bwa panuwa byanuwa i zaro bu hundani muhunj kwa ni hyen, &lt;Hwinsu, huga yama numui, gya buco bu eewo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />&lt;&lt;Ni zwama buco buna, bwe icyagu i ganju bu giya ni yaba Hwinsu yape ba eewo buba sa nga̠ Bufarise. Buna bu dande icwa ibuba ui kanzigab, buna bu kanziga icwa ibuba i dandab.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawo si nuya ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Cyagiya aco a kulagi Yesu saawo si nuya zwama bware danga iba. Inga silmajiri si bware siba hyan, kwa siba ni gazganag. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ama Yesu a uga saawo si nuya kwa ni hyen, &lt;&lt;Curyaji saawo si nuya si kurya ahwamui, ita gazganaga, zwama cigwama ci Hwinsu cisa cyab. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Kamahinda ni zwama, buna bu za icya cigwama ci Hwinsu nga̠ saawo si nuya buza ise.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bugwama buna buzi izana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Bugwama hya bu kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami burya̠, bai gya ni eag zwama gya hyan i hupacu u Hwinsu ana aza ihogu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />&lt;&lt;Zwama igya gu buna uga buco bu burya̠?&gt;&gt; Yesu a kaba ba. &lt;&lt;Aza buna busa bu burya̠ kwa Hwinsu buba. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Bu daki u takada u Musa: &lt;Buza bungi na bua bu buco, buza huni buco, buza eag ihya, buza pana sheda cibya, pan buco abub na amaci abub cilabe.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />&lt;&lt;Kamu cikarigo cina ni kumgagec tun gya bwa bu nuya,&gt;&gt; bware bu hyen.<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Nga̠ Yesu aba huge bware, kwa bware ni hyen ni buba, hal ka baniya &lt;&lt;Bu nagi iyi binka. Sanga ka̠mu ina owo buzi guwo panga aco na za ihya, goo za ci'iru ni zaro. Goo kurya , ni laga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Nga̠ bware bu hugi cikarigo ci Yesu, kwa bware ni dabi suwa, zwama bware buzi dukiya dinyiya. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu a byani bware, &lt;&lt;Uzi wahala pa buco bu musare bubu bui ise cigwama ci Hwinsu! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Harbuni u zake ni sauki u rakumi u ise ni hisa i ajumula si buco buna buzi musare buba bwe ise cigwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Aco na hugi bware, kwa ni kaban, &lt;&lt;Gamba bwe hya ceto?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Kwa yesu ni cyane, &lt;&lt;Ini yamaiyiwo pa aco i ma iya pa Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Bitrus a hya ni bware,&gt;&gt; ci curi kamu ini gacizi kwa nibu lagan!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />&lt;&lt;Kamahinda ni zwama,&gt;&gt; Yesu kwa ni hye, &lt;&lt;Aza buna bwe curi yaba ko hinda bu curi bua ko ahuwo, ko amace na buca buba ko saawo zwama cigwama ci Hwinsu <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />buna bu curi kamu buza inagi i ise baniya, na haya ha cyage hana hayiwa ni kurwa ni isu yaba Hwinsu ana aza ihogu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a jidane cikarigo ci uwo u bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu a zangi silmajiri si bware kupe ni sirya i huga inka,&gt;&gt; ci kari danji zata pa urshalima, kamu ina aba rubuci pa acuma a Hwinsu zwama bwa bu buwama wui sinji. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />I pan bware pa aco eewo. I san bware, icwa bware, i halan bware matan, i iyagya bware bulala hinda a hune bware. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Hwinsu u tacula bware bwe masinge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Silmajiri si bware a ganuwa ihya. ma'ana ma zwamaniya ma swangega, a dakuwo ina bware buyiwa ni kargyaga.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a Hwingacume Burubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Nga Yesu aba yabta Yeriko, burubu hya bu madale ni ugagi u yina buba ni une. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Bu huge aco ni ala, kwa buba ni kaban ini yiwa ni pari. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Azwama bware, &lt;&lt;Yesu Banazaret bube buyiwa ni ala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Kwa burubu ni ugan, Yesu, bwa bu Dauda, huga yama numui!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Aco ni sange kwa ni hin ni buba bu uwatanu ama i hyana ni uge ni ciogo, &lt;&lt;Bwa bu dauda, hugi yama nimu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu a yisa kwa ni hin naba a kuliya bware. Inga bware buba bwa kure ciyabu, Yesu a kaba bware, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;Ibiya goo bu gimbago gya bu ia̠gi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">&lt;&lt;Buca̠ bu yaba, ni gimbago gya hyanagi,&gt;&gt; bware bu cyane.<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu a hin ni bware, &lt;&lt;Bu hwiga; tana i soo nibu ibu hwingacumi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Take kwa bware ni ma hyanaga bware bu laga Yesu ni pan Hwinsu cilabe. Inga aco aba hyan, kwa aba ni pan Hwinsu cilabe.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a ceci Zakka ana cagu gaju.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu a ise Yeriko, burya̠ na alah, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kwa bucahya bulabe buna bu cagu gaju iziya buba Zakka; hinda buza iwa dinya. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Bware ginbagu bu hya yesu hinda bu daki buare, amma bware ponuwa zama bu kwacumi, hinda aco siji dinya. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Zwama harbuniya bware kwa na masanga na muda, kwa na yidana zata uo mucu zwamu bware bu hea yesu, zwamu yina biya yesu aba i laga.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Inga yesu aba wuci i hugniya, kwa buare na zata kwa na hea &lt;&lt;Zakka, kanzige na mabuna, nawuya na hupati na yabnab&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakka kanzigi na mabuna kwa na ca buari na wawuh.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Inga aco hya ina pari, kwa aba kamu na hinana na hea gunaguni, kwa na hea &lt;&lt;Ai yab buco bu magwata̱ bware bu, hupac.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Kwa Zakka na masingya kwa na hya na yesu, &lt;&lt;Huga apin bulabe, na bana rabin ina gyanaza hafsage aco na za ihe . Kamu ana ge na cage, na cupe ga kashi nasi ina ge na ceyaga&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Kwa yesu na hea na bware,&lt;&lt;Nawuya ce kura na yaba na tu na jigo bware busa bua bio Ibrahim, <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Zwamu bwa bu buma bu kure zwamu bu gibage ina enage bu cece ga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu u eag cikarigo ci musare&lt; kupe&gt;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Kamu nga̠ aba yiwa na kublaya numa yesu, bware bu hina na cibaga na misali, zwamu bware bua yabtana urshalima, hinda aco ugana ana cigwama ci Hwinsu i heace take. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Bware bu hye naba, &lt;&lt;A tabu hyan buciyehu bulabe buna bukari hea cihano ci mere zamu a nadi bua cigwama buba bu marigiya. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Kwa buba na pagana ga musare, bu he naba, &lt;Bicikag jemu hal gye na marigiy.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />&lt;&lt;Aco i eugo buba a karuwa bware zwamu harubuniya, kwa aba na cuma buco bweka, &lt;Ci karuwa buare bisa bugwama a bucu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />&lt;&lt;A naji buco buniye bugwama, kwa buba na cumana a gyama kure, ana bware buba panga musare, zamu bu gimbaga daki riba una aba hye na musare muna buba paga.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />&lt;&lt;Buna bu jigo bu kura kwa na hen, &lt;Bulabe, ina guwo buna pa na re riba wai kupe.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Hanu ni ibwana, bugyama abumui!&gt; buca bu yaba bu cane bwa. &lt;Zwama goo bu ia̠ga na burya̠ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Bugyama bu lagiye kwa na hea, &lt;&lt;Buca̠ bu yaba, gyama na hin riba wa pamu uta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Buca bu yaba bu cyane, &lt;&lt;Guma zanga mu'ogo muta, goo sa bugwama maba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Bucagiya bugyama bu kurya kwa na hea, &lt;&lt;Buci bu yaba, pam ike nabo bana; na palagena zuzu kwa gya na iri. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Zwamu na buwasige, zama bugagume zama. Si zangi ihuga na guwa bua iruwa, si iye guba ihuga na goo bua kabuwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Buce buyaba bu cane, &lt;&lt;Na egyata gamba hukunci daidai na cikarigiya ci uno nubo, goo bugyama bu eewo! budaki, ana gye sasa bugaguma bu sha 'ani si zangi i hugaina gya na iruwo, henda iyhe gubo i huga na gya na kubuwa? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />To sibu daki harbuniya gya na yiwa, igya sa ku bua na iruwa musare mummu na banki, sani gya cihano gya bangye riba ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />&lt;&lt;Bugwama bwe hye na aco na yisa ciyabo na buare, &lt;&lt;Caje pamu ike ana ayuwa na wa ubuare ijidani buna bugyama buna buhusi pamu ikupe.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />&lt;&lt;Buce bu yaba,&gt;&gt; a cana buare, &lt;&lt;Bu rigyanu bu hyewu pamu ikupe!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />&lt;&lt;Buce bu yaba bu cane ga, &lt;&lt;Ka̠mu buna buza, i jida bua buna bu za ihe. Ko cimu aza ijidana bu ihye ina ma buba za icagabua. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Aco na ai karuwa gye sa bugwama buab- kuliyaje ga i hunega na gaba namu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso yesu urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Inga yesu iba hogi numa niye, kwa buare na sanga kuro urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Inga Yesu iba yabuta ihuga na aba ugo betafaji na betani ana yiwa agagi zata we e'ogo i'o zaitun, Kwa buare na cuma silmajiri si buare sire. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />&lt;&lt;Kulaje na e'ogo na yiwa gaba nuhin, i isi na ieuogo, yi bangi eewo ya ziyaki a pare ko na buciyehe bua tabu yidana yhe. pasigya ji an ina kulagyi ya a phen . <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Si buciyahe bwe kaba, &lt;&lt;I gya sah gahi pasigyi eha?&gt;&gt; zamana bua, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu duniya bu gyimbago.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Aco na aba cuma aba kwa na kure, a bangi kuma nga̠ ina yesu aba zammaga, <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Aba na pasinge, kwa a huzi na kabana ga &lt;&lt;zwamu egya gahi yiwa na pasige aziyaki?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Kwa aba na cane ga, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone bu gimbo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Kwa na kulagiya yesu aziyaki, kwa aba na bare halapo haba zata wa aziyaki, kwa aba na zagace yesu na jukana zata wa aziyaki. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Inga yesu aba hina cihano, aco kwa na hinan balage halapo haba na yina.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Inga yesu aba yabuta urushalima, kura ihuga yana ikansigi kuruwa zata we i'ogo e'on zaitun, kamu musa silmajiri si bware si hina na goji Hwinsu na hazuga a wawo, na bicaro dinya, zwamu yeya al'ajabi ana aba hye:<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Aba nma zuamaga &lt;&lt;Una buare hu bugwama buna bua kure na ziya i Hwinsu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;Duro uyan na zaro. na cilabe zata!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Kwa hacagiya hapirisiyawa hana hayiwa na aco na hea na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami, butana silmajiri asibo si otani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu i cane &lt;&lt;Nai zamma,&gt;&gt; Yesu bucani, &lt;&lt;Ko acona otani, hatare he zagace na ci'ugo&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Inga yesu aba a yabta iugo urushalima, kwa buare na dara zammu wieba. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Kwa Yesu na hye, &lt;&lt;Nawiya idako, kamu ina i kuliya duro ko dalah burya̠ - ama izah ehyeni zuma hisa a hahin ha ruba. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Lokaci ayuwa na kurah aco na dabiya suwa na ganhi ima ubwaga irigyanui na gahye a yi gasa na ga hye. Hasojoji he iringana tumba usala. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />I hye daje na gahye, hinda i hunaga aco nahi kamu. Azah i cure ko uteye uika wi mahnihe ko hinda a curiye yan'uwa nuheye. Una wi fara zamu ya yajuwa na Hwinsu ukure uci ceci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i ace aco na egu curuma ne kaba wa hunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Inga Yesu a ise iginga kwa na hina na ace aco na yiwa na sage i curuma, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Yesu bu hye nab &lt;&lt;Arubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;I yab namuyi i sana iyab ya hunda,&gt;&gt; gahi irigyuwa gya iyab i cisuya ce ahea.<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Tunuho yesu na cibaga na iginga yaba. Amma alabe i ginga na ha walami ha numa Musa na mugwamgwam mu aco a gimbage a hune buare. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Amma a hinwo yina una aba i huni buare cikariguwa ci buare ci zangi hankali aba kamu, hinda akaruwa icibagu ibuare i haciga.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="r">Aco ayi makab ma cigwama ci Yesu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Wahye yesu na cibaga aco cikarigo ci hwinsu na yab ya hunda buare na yhea wa'azi na pana labari wa laco wa aco, kwa alabe na hawalami he cibago numa musa aba na mugwamgwam aco a kura pa buare. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />&lt;&lt;Ci zuma na koce gamba goo bu yiwa na ia̠ga ina.&gt;&gt; Aba kabba. &lt;&lt;Gamba bwe pah koce?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Buare bu cane, &lt;&lt;Gyama nai kabana. Na zammaje. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Yohanna u baptisma - u kure na zaro ko u kura pa wuaco?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Kwa aba na ma ugana zuma daki nga̠ icani buare, a hye, &lt;&lt;Si ci hye na buare, &lt;&lt;Na zaro,&gt;&gt; buare bwe cikabana, igya sa gahi ya yasowa na buare?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Si cane buare, &lt;&lt;Buare bu sire pa wuma, kamu aco i ci buaga na hatare, zuma aco kamu a yaje yohanna usa bu cibago bu huisu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Kwa aba na cane bware, ca dakuwo pa buare buba sirya.<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Kwa Yesu na cani bware, &lt;&lt;Gya ma na za na zwamana ko na koce u gamba gya na yiwa na ia̠ ina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a i misali aco na ciye haya itah inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu kwa na hina zamma gana ga misali: &lt;&lt;Buca hya bu i inta bu kabe inabi. Kwa buba na ma kulana ci hano kuro cicagiya cinye, bu sani dinya pa cihano cibuba. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Lokaci a guba a wuco, kwa buba na cumani bugema bu buba, pa co na cage haya, bucagiya bu saawo si inabi sina si suwa u inta. Ama aco haya kwa na paje bu i huna, kwa na sibuka bua wa bire <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Buare kwa na jidana cumana bu cigaya bugema, amma aco na ciya haya u itah kwa na yame bu hunna har na yheguw buba walakanci, a ace bu wa bire. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Haila baniya buco buniye bu jidana cuma bugama bu taculah, buba kwa abba na cumi buah, kwa na kwamma bua na jepu.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Kwa buhuzi, bu inta wa inabi na hea, &lt;&lt;Baniya biya gya na ia̠? na cumana bua abummu buna gye na ka̠ri, na daki lailai i pana bua cilabe!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Amma nga̠ aco haya aba hye buare kwa aba na mazama,&lt;&lt;Aha! bena buna bwere gado u itana, cihuni bua, gado uba sa nuciye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Kwa aba na kwama buare kacuta icu buaga na jepu, kwa na huni buare.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">&lt;&lt;Naiya gahe iyiwa na tunanae buhuzibu inta buba bui hin na aco haya? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Bui kurya bu hunage aco haya, buba bu pa cagiya aco haya inta niya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">nga̱ aco aba huge numa niya, kwa aba na hea, &lt;&lt;Hwisu u yagage!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu kwa aba na benaga kwa na kabana ga, &lt;&lt;Ibiya isa ma'ana numa Hwinsu ina aba rubuci?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt; &lt;Utare una aco ima yu kaba aba wonje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ubiya wa sanu ipicu wi imah&gt;?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Ka̱mu buna bua hene zata na teye bui hoga na ma bubsage, si tare niye u hine u dabi buco wi namaga bua, bui yana nga̱ muhe,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Hawalami hi cibagu numa musa na a labe-labe, a benga ihuga inas aba i kumbe buare take, zwamu a daki buare bu'iyi misali naba amma a huge i was ya aco.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">I cupo i ganju pa mugwamgwam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />A gimbage hina una aba ucumbe bware, kwa na cumage bware aciyehe a iye nga̱ aco burya̠. A yiwa na fata a kumbe Yesu na, magwata̱ cimu aba kula bware pa aco cigwama. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Aco na aba cuma kwa na kaba na bware; &lt;&lt;Walami, ci daki si cibagu na numa na bua, isa i kamahinda, cidaki hinda bua cibagwa banbaci, si cibage yina wu Hwinsu, na kamhinda. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />To, bu hin u i gama gacu ci cupe ganju pa kaisar, ko cita cupa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesu a daki soo waba, kwa na hin naba, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />&lt;&lt;Na cibiya ce dinari hoto ugamba na ziya i gamba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Kaisar, &gt;&gt; a cane bware.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:25">Kwa buare na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Pana je kaisar ina isa i kaisar, ina isa i Hwinsu a pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />A pwanakanuwa i kumbe bware na ina aba a zame pa aco. mamaki uhene ga na cane ina Yesu aba a caniga. Ka̱mu kwa aba na tana.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kaba yesu zama yiansiguwa aco na a kodago na cigye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />kwa ha sadukiyawa, hana ha yajuwa na wasuguwa wa aco na a kodago, na kure pa yesu na kabana yesu. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />&lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; a hin, &lt;&lt;Musa u rubuci si buhu a za saawo, buhu bu numiya bua shatana bu'a zama bu ia̱gi buhu buba saawo. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Baniya ahuwa wuci utantare. buna bu jigo bu ze kwa buba na koji bu za saawo na buba. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Buna bu lagiye <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Na buna bu tacula a ziye bua ka̱mu, harbuniya kamu kura buna bu tandare buba ma bu kwaji bu hiwu saawo. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />zwamuniya ka̱mu, kwa bu'a na kwaji. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Baniya, hun na Hwinsu uba a̠senge aco na u'o bui sana bu'a bu ganba</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 20:33">zwamu ka̱mu waba a ziye bo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu i canega, &lt;&lt;Aco na zamani a ia̱gu jige a pangamu cige hinda. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ama aco ana makamaci na uwasuguwa wa aco na a kodagu hinda ama daliya na zamani ana a yiwa na kara, a za iyhe cige ko pan cinge. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Hinda a zah yi kodakana; zama baniya a neganuwa na acuma a Hwinsu. Ai sanuwa saawo si Hwinsu, zwam a sanua sauwo si wasigegu wa aco na a kodago. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Musa wucibiya na fili ana aco na kwadagi i masinge na labari uor na u yiwa na cah ula, uyi cikariguwa ubiya usa Hwinsu wi Ibrahim, Hwinsu wi Ishaku, Hwinsu wi Yakub. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Wa sah Hwinsu wi kwadagu, amma wa aco a̱huru, zwamu harbuni ka̱mu ina iza a̱huru i yiwa na wa u burya̠?<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Kwa hawalami ha cibago i Musa na cani Yesu &lt;&lt;Walami, bu kargega daidai&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Aza buna bu kabaka bware cikarigo.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asa bwa bu gamba?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu a hea naba, &lt;&lt;Neya aba i hin Kristi as bwa bu Dauda? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dauda na icwa i bware bu hin na suwa numa Hwinsu na zabura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Buca abumui bu hin na buca abumui:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Madale na wa wu cuga numuya.<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Kwa huna gya na sah ana bu wanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">aba kusje na buna nabo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dauda u uga bwa &lt;&lt;Buce abum?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:44">Neya bware buba bwesana bua bu bware?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ka̱mu aco kwa kubuliy cikariguwa ci bware, Yesu a hea na silamajiri si bware, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;Masikije na cibago ha walami ha musa. A kari cihano na aco na sangana ga na kasuwa hinda azangi mudaluwa mu musama na iginga hinda na pagana ga cilabe na huga ilago. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Abiya a ryago kona i si'ah sina si nagagi sare' hinda si yiwa na ye a hunda aba zangaliyi zwamu a hea ga. Ai abiya iso hukunci a Hwinsu dinyiya.<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Ipanu i sadaka bua buna bu bware buba kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Inga Yesu buba byani zata kwa a hyan aco na za izan aba ni tagano sadaka na ihuga ina aba tagano sadaka na iginga. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Hinda kwa Yesu ni hyan bu'a buna buza ihya buna bu bware buba kwaji bu tane sinini sirya. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />&lt;&lt;Kamahinda ni zwama,&gt;&gt; Yesu bu hin, &lt;&lt;I hyen bua buna butane sadaka abuba u zaki kamu cyagiye aco. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kamu acona panga sadaka na suwa wui izana yaba; iba na nagu wui izana iba pa kamu ina iba za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alama i hogu i doone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Ciki a silmajiri si bware ayiwa ni cikariguwo nga̠ aba ma iginga iba gyamaci na daji una aba si kulagya pa Hwinsu. Ama Yesu u hyen, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Sosa zwama ina ganhi hyan, lokaci ayiwa ni kuro ko ni utare una uyana zata na ucyage; i huzouwa a kwama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />&lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; akaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Bimba ina ibe i kure? Hinda ibe isana alama si ikaro pare?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu a cyani: &lt;&lt;Eaji hankali ata kulgana. Aco dinyiya i kuri ni ize nimu, i hyan, &lt;gyamui nisa Yesu,&gt; hinda, &lt;Lokaci a kurwa,&gt;&gt; ita laganaga. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Si hoge ijumui igas na huisuma, ita huga iwasa.Una kamu dole wui kury kacumo, ama i hogu yasa kurya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Kwa Yesu ni hyen naba: &lt;&lt;Azwaga i masinga a kulta azwaga, cigwama ci wonje cigwama. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Yesu i hyen i hugi ijumu i cinge ni imiro na masipa mu huga daban, iyi wasa i kure ni alama ni zaro.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />&lt;&lt;Ama kafin ini pari, itani wa na ga̱hi i pan wahala. i kulaga ni muginga ni yaba u ci'incu, i kula hu mugwamgwam ni ha gwamnoni, zwama ni izi nimui. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Uni ui san zwama sheda nimui. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ama tanaji suwa ta madama si akule pa aba ni ini ga̱hi i hyen naba. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Zwama ni pan cikarigo na mahasa mana ko buwoda abuhin buna bui pwana wonje. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />I wundag hal amace nuhiya, na hun nahiya na dangi nuhiya na siboki, i hunaga ciki nahi hal kula uwo. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Kamu aco i wundaga zwama numuyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ama ko ahinji ai ecwa nihin i inaga. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Zwama iyisano i koce nuhin iza i nagi a̱huru nahin.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />&lt;&lt;Si i hyan Urshalima a ringa uwa na hasojoji i daki lokaci ayabtana. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Aco ni yiwa na Yahudiya a kore na munda kuruwa zata mu'ogo, ana iyiwa na suwa wui iogo a sire, ana ayiwa ni hila ata isa iogo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Zwama lokaci horo ni hukunci una aba rubuci u sinji. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Kaito u sa'a sina siza mukaba na sina si panagano saawo mosubo! Zwamo iwo i ise ni cinge cina na aco. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />I hunaga cyage aco na kashekari i zangi cagiya aco ni ukaba ci'incu kuruwa sizwaga kamu. Ana asa Hayahudawa i pan Urshalima wahala hal ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu u sinji.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Hinda i hyan alama na hwinsu, pyana na muginga. ni cinge, sizwaga si yana ni wasa zwama i punagu i uwo. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Aco cware i matag zwama i wasa, zwama ina iyiwa ni kuro ni duniya, zwama zaro ui yana majuguta. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Na lokaci buni aba i hyan Bwa bu Buwama ni kurya ni suwa ulala na koce ni cilabe cibware. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Si hyano ini ya rwago i, masingaije idande icwa zata zwama icagagu nahi ayabtano.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yesu a zwamaga misali ana: &lt;&lt;Byana uo u muco ka̱mu na e'on. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Si u'on u muco urwage ibulagya mabula mapu, bui hyan ni ico nibu siya u yabtano. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Harbuni hinda, si i hyan ini ka̱mu i daki cigwama ci Hwinsu ci yabtana.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />&lt;&lt;Kamahinda ni zwama, aco zamani una aza kwaji kamu zwamauna kwa i pare. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Zaro ni cinge ui ala ka̱mu ama cikarigo acumui ciza ala.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />&lt;&lt;Masikuiji, zwama suwa nuhi ui zanga, cisu ci maro, ni hugo i laco, si sa harbuni huni ui kure iza labari nga̱ kaciba. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Zwama ui kure ni ecwa i tigamba buna buyiwa na doone. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Zwama harbuniya tana haisa, hinda ia̱ga̱ ahunda̱ nga̱ go sirya ka̱mu ina ka̱ri pala, nga̠ goo bui yisan pa bwa bu Buco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Tuhumba hwinsu Yesu sa acibagi ni suwa iginga, tun na yumbe bware si i sire si iyi zata u iogo i zaitun, <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Hinda ka̱mu aco si kurya nubungwa mainta na suwa wai iginga zwama a hugage bware.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Yahuda i yaje i pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Baniya lago u burodi aba ai tanuwa ina si pwocume burodi, una aba yiwa ni oge lago we Kacikago, u yabuto, <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />hinda bulabe bu labe na hawalami hai icibago i Musa hab na ginbago yina hab hai hone Yesu, zwama a yiwa ni hoge iwasaya aco. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Kwa Shetan ni ese shuwa u Yahuda, ina aba yiwa na oge Iskariyoti, iba ise ciki u silmajiri ikope na sirya. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Hinda kwa Yahuda Iskariyoti ni kore pa Bulabe bu labena aco lab na yiwa ea anpe u iginga i labe na ea cikarigo nab nga̠ iba i cutan Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Kwa aba ni hoge laco dinya hinda kwa aba ni yaje musare muna aba ai pan bware. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yahuda bu yaje,Kwa na tana haisa ko bwe hyan apacu ana buba bwe cutanbga Yesu sa na cidako ca aco.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i re mare mai kacigago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Inga hon lago ui re burodi una aba ai tanuwa ina i san ui masingewa una aba ai baciga ujumag. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu icuma Bitrus na Yohana, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Alo je i kimga ihug ina gaci ci re mare mai Ikacigago.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />&lt;&lt;Humba goo bu ginbo ci kimga ihug ina gaci ci re?&gt;&gt; kwa aba ni kaban.<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Kwa Yesu na cane ga, &lt;&lt;Si es na shuwa we e'ogo, i bangi buco na utako u miya bwe bangi. Lagana bwa na yaba ina boba boi ese, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />hinda ganhi i hya na buhuzi bu yaba, Walami u kabo: Ukabo u hanyagata u yiwa hunba, ihuga ina gya na remare mai ikacigagona silmajiri a simui?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Bui ciba ukaba u labe u zata, una aba kimga.Kimgan a payi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Kwa aba na alo kwa aba na bangi nga̠ Yesu eba zwama ga.Kwa aba na kimgan ihuga i mare mai kacigago.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Inga lokaci uba i,Yesu na silmajiri sibuba kwa na madala zwama ire mare. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Kwa Yesu na hyen nab, &lt;&lt;Na cimgago ire mare mana na mai ikacigago na ganhi kapi gya isho wahala. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ni zwama, ni zawa iryakana kwa a sinji cikarigo na cigwama ci Hwinsu na zaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Inga buba zangi adanda a miya ma saawo si inabi, kwa nai goji Hwinsu kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Zangi ja ima habusage. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ne zwama Na za ishakana miya mai imata i inabi cigwama ci Hwinsu uba zwamage ci aliyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Kwa bware na zangi burodi, kwa na pan ga, nga̠ bware buba goji Hwinsu kwa buba nigundag, kwa na pan ga, ni zwamag, &lt;&lt;Ikanga nimu bina ina i gya na pan; ihina na eago harbuniyazwa ubutaryago na gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Harbuni, nga̠ Yesu na silmajiri aba hogi ire mare kwa Yesu na zangi adanda, Buba na hyen, &lt;&lt;Adanda ana asa kucuna kuna kusa ku mahya a amamui, man mab jigi zwama ganhi. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ama buna bu kari na cutan ciyiwa na re mare na buba apini. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Bwa bu Buco bwe ala nga̠ aba zwamage, ama kaito ubuna bu ka̱ri na cutan Bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Kwa aba ni hinan na makaban ganba buna bwe eag haruni.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kwa silmajiri na masinge na gardama an ganba bwe san buco bu labe. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu kwa na hyen nab, &lt;&lt;Mugwamgwam muna mu aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu sa cibe aco ayiwa ne lagan ga koce hinda aco labe ba cibe an aba yiwa ni hoge yama yaba. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ama ganhi ita sana nga̠ ba.Kwadi, buna busa bu labe bwesana nga̠ bwa bunoya, hinda bu labe busan nga̠ bugyama. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ganba busa bu labe, buna bu madale ko di buna bwe pana aco mare?Sa buna bu yiwa na anpa a pan bwa?Ama gya na yiwa na ganhi nga̠ bugyama abuhin. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />gahin i yisa tare na gya lokaci una aba yiwa na gwadag. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Hinda gya na pano koce u cigwama , nga̠ buca a bumui buba na pan gya, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Inga ganhi i madala na gya ni cigwama ci Hwinsu i zaro ganhi na re na isho tare na gya na yaba nimui izaro ama dale ni idalo icugwam, ganhi na eagya sizwaga ikope na sirya na cinge ci Israila.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Kwa Yesu na hyen, &lt;&lt;Bitrus, Bitrus, Shaitan a ginbage ai gwaji kamu nuhin nga̠ aba sa gyare Alkama. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ama na eia̱gu ahunda̱, Bitrus,nga̠ itano ni boi ishuwa ita marigiya cinmu. Hinda si bu marige kacuta, go gope ijidana ahun nabwe koc ushuwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Bitrus a cane, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,Gya ne bu lagana hal kurwa ukaba u ci'incu hal ko bu kari ci koji na go.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Ne zwama, Bitrus kapi uka̱ri u uga nawuya, bui hin an bui na dakuwo hal kurwo utaco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Kwa Yesu na kaban ga, &lt;&lt;Si ni cuma ni panuwa ipamo, iryajapu ko hatak, aza ina inagi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">&lt;&lt;Ko na ihya,&gt;&gt; a cane bware.<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Bware bu hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ama nawuya buna bu za ipamo, buzangi, ka̱mu na ipamo; hinda si bu za kasakari, sanga cilapo go sane. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Harbuni cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin: &lt;Atanani Bware na aco magwata̱&gt;; hinda na hin na ga̱hi usa dole asinji ini na gya. Harbuni, ina aba zwamage zwama gya i karo isinji.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Kwa silmajiri na hin, &lt;&lt;Byana, Bugwama bu doone, kasakari karya a kan.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ka jobe,&gt;&gt; Bware nu cane.<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i ea ahunda̱ zata wa a'ogo a i'on zaitun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Nga̱ Yesu i yinda zata u a'ogo a zaitun, kwa silmajiri si bware ni lagan Bware. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Nga̱ buba wuci ihugo ini, kwa ni hyen nab, Eago ja anhunda ita esa paikwaju.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kwa Yesu na madajiga cimu iga i kwamano u tare zata na ba,kwa bware ni ikuzat kwa na ea anhunda har buna, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Buca a bumui, sibu yaje, zangaca adanda na ahwamui'; sa na maka̠la̠ ma shuwa numuiya, kwa di maka̠la̠ a mabuya.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Kwa bucuma bu Hwinsu na kurya ni zaro ni jidana yesu koce. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ama zwama buba na shuwa u sungorwa, kwa buba na majidaga eagu anhunda, hinda ibwaza na jinke na ikanga ibware hagoda ha mahyan na hinag na cinge.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Inga Yesu iba masinge pa anhunda kwa na kore silmajiri si bware, bu bangi siba na malabo, zwama shuwa wabu hacigage dinya. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />&lt;&lt;Baisan ganhi iyiwa na malabo?&gt;&gt; Bukabo ga. &lt;&lt;Masinge ji i yi anhunda zwama shatan ita isa na shuwa nuhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Bware buba na cikarigo kwa aco na matanaga na kure pa bware, hinda buco buna aba yiwa ne oge Yahuda,busa pa silmajiri ikope na sirya,bwa sangacume ga. Bu yabutani pa Yesu kwa wushuman Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />kwa Yesu na kaban bware, &lt;&lt;Yahuda, bu ka̱ri icutan bwa bu Buco na sunsubanu i usuga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Inga aco na yiwa tare na Yesu aba hyen ina i, kwa aba na hyen, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu juniya, ci buzge na kasakari?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Kwa almajiri aikan na gunji bugyama bu bulabu labe boi iginga, hal bu gunji bwa cube u wa cuga.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ama Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Uni u za!&gt;&gt; Kwa Bware na danga cube u buba kwa uba ni hwenga,<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Kwa Yesu na hyen Bulabe bu labe, aco labe na anpan iginga, na alabe,an a kurya zwama akonbe bware, &lt;&lt;Ikurya na kunba na kasakari, na sigungu, nga̠ na sa buhya? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Tunhumba ni yiwa ni muginga ni ga̠hi, i hyanuwo dalili una u gahi eni kumba. Ama lokaci nuhi u kurya una ui ibwana i ci'incu ciba ci eag cigwama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a hyen ani ai dakuwo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Kwa aba ni kumbi bware kwa ni kula bware pa yaba i bulabe. Bitrus a hina ni laganaga ni cimire. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Inga aba sala ni suwo u yaba kwa ni madala kamu waba, Bitrus kwa ni madala nab. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Bu gyama bu cu'a ikangaza bu biske bware kwa bu madale pa ula, kwa iba ni byana bware na burya̠ , &lt;&lt;Buco buna buyiwa tare ni Yesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Kwa bitrus ni hyen ana bwe dakuwo iya &lt;&lt;Bu'a, Ni dakuwo bware,&gt;&gt; bwre bu hin.<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Inga i ma gidani cimu bu cyage buco bu bisike bware kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Guwoma buyiwa tare naba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">&lt;&lt;Buco, sa gyamuya!&gt;&gt; Bitrus a cyane.<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Inga awa ika aba iyi kwa bucage buco ni bisika bware kamahinda, &lt;&lt;Niza tantama buco buna a yase ni Yesu, zwama bware busa buco bu Galili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Bitrus a cani, &lt;&lt;Ni hin na guwo ni dakuwo ina guwo biyiwa nim cikarigo ciba!&gt;&gt; Bui gudanuwo unu, kwa ukari ni ugan. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Kwa Buca̱ bu yaba ni byana Bitrusu kwa ni gama hisa. Bitrus kwa ni mabutragya ina Buca̱ bu yaba buba zwama bware &lt;&lt;Kafin uka̱ri u uga nawui, bui hin ani bui ni dakuwo hala kurwa utaco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Kwa Bitrus ni sire ni gyapu kwa ni tadan cidaro dinyiya.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aco ape egiyi Yesu alala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Acona abapan ape u Yesu a hina ni ega bware alala ni jugraga bware. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Kwa aba ni kubtan bware hisa kwa aba ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ci zwamana gamba bu mare?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Kwa aba ni gupa eagya bware alala iyi dinyiya.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kuli Yesu pa Bilatus na Hiridus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Nubunga ma'inta a'ungo i iogo i labe, ni bulabe na hawalami i cibago i Musa a madale kwa ni kula Yesu pa aba. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Si gabwe busa Kristi,&gt;&gt; A hin, &lt;&lt;Ci zwama.&gt;&gt; Yesu i cani, &lt;&lt;Si ni zwama iza yaje ina gya nihin ni gahi, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Hinda si ni kaba, iza na cyana. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ama kurwa baniya, bwa bu buwama bwe madala ni wa u cuga u Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Kwa kamuwaba ni cyani, &lt;&lt;Baniya gabuya busa bwa bu Hwinsu?&gt;&gt; Bware bu cyani, na burya̠ ana gya nasa bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Kwa aba nim hin, &lt;&lt;Biya gaci gimbago ci hugi hinda? Ci riganu ci hugo pa unu bware.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Aco na amatanaga kamu kwa ni masinge a kule Yesu pa Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Kwa aba na rwaga i cuwo, a hyan, &lt;&lt;Ci kumbe buco buna bware buyiwa ni hacigag aco, bu gazga aco na icupago ganju pa Kaisal bware bube busa kristi, bugwama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Bilatus bu kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gabwe busa Bugwama bu Yahudawa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">&lt;&lt;Harbuniya nga̠ guwo bu hyen,&gt;&gt; Yesu a cyani.<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Kwa Bilatus ni zwamana bulabe bulabe bu labe na aco na matanaga, &lt;&lt;Na kumbuwa buco buna ni eewo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ama a masi bware, &lt;&lt;Bware bu hacigagi aco ni cibagu i bware ni Yahudiya kamu. Bware bu rwagi ni Galili kurwa tuhumba kamu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Inga bu hugiga, kwa Bilatus ni kaban si bware busa buco bu Galili. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Inga Bilatus buba huge Yesu a sirya pa cinge Hiridus a ringe Yesu pa bugwama Hiridus, buna bu yansi na Urshalima ni lokacini.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Nga̠ Hiridus aba hyan Yesu, kwa bware ni hugi wawo dinyiya zwam u sanu bware ni gimbo bu hyan Yesu. zwam bware bu huge game na bware hinda bware bu yiwa na tani soo bu hyan Yesu na ia̠ iyi i mamaki. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Kwa Hiridus na ia̠gi Yesu makaba̠ dinyiya, ama Yesu a cyana bware. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bulabe ni walami i cibago i Musa a yisa ni pan bware laipi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Hinda Hiridus na hasoja ha bware kwa ni ia̠gya Yesu alala. a bwada bware cilapo ci cigwama kwa ni ringya bware pa Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Hon buni Hiridus ni Bilatus aba asan siboki, kapin huni ama ka̠la̠nguwo.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bilatus bu uga bulabe labe mugwamgwam na aco, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kwa ni hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Ina buco buna nga̠ buna si sa aco bu yasingage. ama ni kabganu bware ni sinu nuhin na kumbuwa bware ni laifi hya ini ga̱hi hyan bware bu iyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Harbuni ma Hiridus, bware bu bware pa hwaci; nga̠ gahi hyan bware bu iyiwa ihya wa kamacuwa bware kwaji. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Zwama na pan bware horo gya curi bware. <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />hwinsu u lago i kacuwo si curi buco bu laifi bweka.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ni bicwaro bweka aba ni sanan ci ogo alaji ni buco buna ci curgagiya Barabbas!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Barabas a tani bware ni ukaba u ci'incu zwama bware si ia̱gi mugwamgwa tawaye ni huni buco.) <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Bware bu kari su i curya Yesu, Bilatus u jidani rokoga. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />A hina ni sangani ciogo a otanuwo &lt;&lt;huniji bware! huniji bware!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Bware bu jidani ia̠gaga cikarigo kashi u tacula: &lt;&lt;Zwama igy? Laifi a bigya buco buna buba iyi? bware bwa iyo laifi una ui sana bware kwaji.zwaharbuni ni pni bware horo gya curi bware bu ali.<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ama a dandi bicwaro ni ciogo ani huni bware. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Bilatus apa ga ini aba gimba. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kwa bware ni curgagyaga buco buna bu yase ni yaba u ci'incu, una aba gimba a curya kwa ni zangi Yesu madadi a Barabas.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">I jukuwo Yesu ni u'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Inga aba ali ni Yesu, kwa ni magama ni siman buco bu Sayirin, buna bu yasi ni cihano kwa ni san bware bu zangi io u jikuwu u Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Aco dinyiya kwa ni lagan bware tare ni aco cwa ana dare zwama bware. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu a byaniga kwa ni hyi naba, &lt;&lt;Si'a si Urshalima, ita eag cidaro zwama gya; eag cidaro zwama icwa nuhi na saawo asihin. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Zwama lokaci ayiwa ni kuro, i hyan, &lt;&lt;Unu u burya̠ usa pa si'a sina sa matangwa, na umaciswa una wasatabuwa zangi mukaba na hasubo hana asa tabuwa asubana!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Hinda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt; &lt;I hin ni mu'ogo, &lt;&lt;Cidabya!&gt;&gt; i hyen na ha i'ogo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt;Ci kubtanya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Si aco egyi ina na uo uba wanla, neya aba ai eagya i una u huye?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Cyagiya aco barya, asa aco eewo, a kulega tare i huga inka ni Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Inga aba wuci ihugana aba ugo akuku, apayi aba jukai bware tare na ahya barya-buco bweka ni wa u cuga, bweka ni wa gula. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu a hyan, &lt;&lt;Buca abumui, yafega zwama adakuwo ina aba iyagu.&gt;&gt; kwa aba ni mahabsaga hazunga habware ni iwo icaca.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Aco yisinga aba ni mugingo, ni mugwamgwam mu egyi bware alal. ahyan, &lt;&lt;Bware bu ceci cyagiya aco; bwa cagage icwa i bware si bware bu san Kristi a Hwinsu buna aba tanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Ha musoja haba ma ha kure kwa ni ia̠gya bware alala. Apa bware usungurwa <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Si busa bugwama bu Hayahudawa cya icwa nibu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />A i cihero zata ni icwa bware, arubuce a hyan: BUGWAMA BU HAYAHUDAWA ABUNA.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Buco bweka buna aba jukaiga bu ia̱gi bware alala: &lt;&lt;Sa gabuya busa Kristi ceto icwa nibu ni gacu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ama bweka buna aba jukaiga tare bubu tane bulagi bu buba, &lt;&lt;Buza iwasa i Hwinsu,&gt;&gt; bu hyan, &lt;&lt;Hukunci nuciyausa uika? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Aci egyi hukunci daidai ni eewo nuci hinda ukamace ama buco buna bwa iwo laifi ahya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kwa Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Yesu, mabutaragi ni gya si bu kure nga̠ bugwama .&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu a cane buhya na wa ucuga ububa, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda nibu zwama, nawuya bwe yana ni gya ni Yaba Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Baniya awa cunihi, kwa ci'incu ni kubtan cinge hal awa tanasi, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />hwinsu kwa ni gundan. Kwa ulapo u iginga ni mahanji cirya. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu kwa ni uga ni bicwaro dinyiya, &lt;&lt;Buco abumui ni wa nabu gya ni pa muhuju amumui.&gt;&gt; nga̠ bware bu hyen haruni kwa bware ni curya muhoju.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Inga buco buna bu apa, bu hyan ini pare, bu pa Hwinsu cilabe kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Lailai buco buna busa bu burya̠ .&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Ka̱mu aco ni matanaga a hyan ina pare ansupagi bisan kwa ni ma alan. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ama kamu aco ni daki Yesu, tare ni si'a sina sa laga bware ni Galili, a yisa cimire, ni hyanaga ini yiwa ni ia̱ga.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">I wumbani i Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Baniya azi bucahya buna aba ugo Yusuf bware bu yiwa ni suwo Parisiyawa, bware bu gyamaci suwa hinda busa bu burya̠, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />bware bwe laganuwa ni eewo yaba. Bware bu sirya Yahuda ni i'ogo ina aba ugo Arimatiya bware bu apgage yaba cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Bware bu kuri pa Bilatus kwa ni kaban ikanga i Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Bware bu kanzgiye ni cinge, kwa ni nadaga nya̠ na ulapo kwa ni wumban ikanga ni iziyi na, ko na buna aba taba tana. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Huniya usase hwinsu ui kimgan, asabar a yabtana.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Si'a sina sa kore tare ni Yesu ni i'ogo i Galili alaga Yusuf a hyan iziyi nga̠ aba labti ikanga i Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Kwa aba ni ala giwu zwama ashiri tulare na manube ma kamshi. Ama a hupaci hwinsu u asabar nga̠ icibago i musa iba hyen.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Wasingo u Yesu pa aco na kwadagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Na ubungwa ma'enta hon lahadi si'a si kure na manube ma kamshi pa iziyi,man siba kimga. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Kwa ni bangya tare a swabkan, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Ama nga̠ aba ise, abanguwa ikanga Bugwama bu duniya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Aba ni eag tunani ni ina aba hyan, kwa aco barya na hazunga ha cine nga̠ ula a yisa ciyabu nab. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Iwasa kwa ni kumbega kwa aba ni kuztan sinu yaba ni cinge, ama kwa aconi ni hyen naba, &lt;&lt;Biya sa gahi uyiwa ni gimbo buco buna buyiwa pa aco ni kwaji? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Bware buza; bware bu masingo! Mabutaragiji nga̠ bware bu zwam, nga̠ bware bu yasa ni gahi ni suwa Galili: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />&lt;Bwa bu buwama i cutani bwa ni suwa si aco eago eewo, i huni bware ni muhun mutacula bwe masinga hinda.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Kwa aba ni mabuturagi cikarogo ci bware.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Inga aba a maringiya pa iziyi, kwa aba ni zwama silmajiri kupe ni ika kamu ni si cagiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Maryamu magadalin, ni Yowana, ni Maryamu mana ma Yakub ni si cyage si'a sina si yiwa tare na saba abe asa si'a sina si zwama silmajiri si Yesu ina ya pale. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ama a yajuwa ni cikarigo ci si'a, zwama a huge cikarigo ciyaba nga̠ cisa ci kawai. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Bitrus, bware bu masinge ni munda kure wui iziyi. Bware bu kuki, kwa ni hyan ulapo u cine uba ni cinge, kwa bware ni mawalan, bware ni makargyan ni suwa buba ibe pari.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yina u kuruwa Imawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Huni bye hya barya aba ni kurwa hila ana aba ugo Imawus, mil tandarya kurwa Urshalima. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Aba ni cikarigo zwama ina pare. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Aba ni cikarigo ina pare, Yesu ni icwa bware a kure aba jabag tare naba; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ama bware bu swangiyega a ganuwa bware.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Bware bu kabaga, &lt;&lt;Iya gahi ni kargyaga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">kwa ni yisan hugo inka, suwaba u hacigagi. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Buika ciki aba buna aba ugo Kiliyobas, kaba bware, &lt;&lt;Ama guwo usa unyagata kawai ni Urshalima bwadakuwo ina pare ni muhun muniya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu i kabo ga &lt;&lt;Ibai pare?&gt;&gt; bware bu kaba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">&lt;&lt;Zwama Yesu u Nazaret a cane.&gt;&gt; bware basu bucubagu, cikarigo ci buba cizi kuce pa Hwinsuna aco kamu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bulabe ni mugwamgwam abe kule bware a hune bware, hinda jukai bware; <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ama ci tani soo bware bo kari caga aco Isra'ila. Hinda ci ugana, bayan muhu mutaco zwama uni uba pari. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ni jidanu hinda, ciki a si'a sisu si'i zwama mamaki. a kuri ni ziyi ni ubungwa ma'inta nawuya <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Ama a banguwo ikanga i bware. A kurya ci zwama a iyi hyanu pa bucuma bu Hwinsu, buna bu hin ana bware busa hargu. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Hinda hwa ciki naciya a kuri pa iziyi kwa ni bangi ina sia siba zwamaga ama a hyanuwo bware.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu bu hin naba, haba gahi aco nagu tunani, ni nagu suwa wui yaju ina kamu acubagu aba kargyage! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ashe sa Kristi a su wahala kacumo bware ise pa cilabe ci bware? <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Urwagu ni Musa ni kamu acuma Hwinsu, bware bu eagyaga bayani ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyan.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Inga aba yabta i oga ni aba gimba kure, Yesu ea nga̠ i ka̠ri hwace ihugo. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ama kwa aba ni une bware, &lt;&lt;Yisan pa gaci, zwama uyinbe u iwo; gita a iwo.&gt;&gt; kwa bware ni ise tari nab.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Aba ni re mare, kwa bware ni zangi burodi, bware bu goji Hwinsu, kwa ni buse kwa ni panaga. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Kwa hisa haba ni magunja kwa aba ni gani bware, kwa bware ni inag paba. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Kwa aba ni makaban, &lt;&lt;Besa hasuwo ahahi hahupuwo bware ni cikarigo ni gaci ni yina hinda buciba cikarigo ci Hwinsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Kwa aba ni masinga kwa ni ala Urshalima. Apayi aba bangi silmajiri kupe na ika , kwa si matanaga huga inka <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />ni zwamag, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda! bugwama bu duniya bu masingwa bu silta Bitrus.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Kwa silmajiri sirya si zwamaga ini egyi ni yina,hinda nga̠ Yesu iba gunji hisa haba nga̠ iba paga burodi<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asilta silmajiri seba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Tun aba ni cikarigo zwama iyi ni, Yesu ni icwa bware a yisa ni suwab kwa bware ni hin nab &lt;&lt;Unu uburya̠ u yana gahi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Iwasa i kumbega aba ni daglag ikanga, aba ni tunani nga̠ hyan patalwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Bware bu hin nab, &lt;&lt;Bisa ga̱hi hugi iwasa, biya sa nagu u yaju ni suwa nihi? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Hyaniji wa numui ni buna numui. Gyamui ni icwa nimui! Ni dangiji i hya; upatalwa uza munigwa ni ha upa, nga̠ gahi hya niza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Inga bware bwa hogu cikarigo cini, bware bu cibega wa ni buna bware. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Tun aba ni nagu u yaju zwama wa̱wo na mamaki, bware bu kabaga, &lt;&lt;Iza mare ma cire piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Kwa aba na pan bware i kindi i irege ni burodi, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Yesu bu ce kwa ni re ni hisa aba.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Yesu bu hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ina gya ni tab zwamagya ni ga̱hi: Tuwamba ka̱mu wui sinji ina aba rubuci zwama numu ni utakada u cibago I musa, Acubago ni utakada u zabura.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Kwa Yesu ni gunja suwa wab zwama adakya cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Bware bu zwamaga, &lt;&lt;Ina aba rubuci: Kristi ui su wahala hinda bu masingiya pa aco ni kwadagi pa hwinsu u tacula, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Curyagu eewo ni hiwo gafara u eewo i cubaga ni ize ibware pa aco ka̱mu, i rwaga ni urshalima. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Gahi yi sana sheda ina ka̱mu. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ni kari ni cuman ina buca abumui buba iyi alkawali; ama i yisa ni suwa ui iogo kwa huna aba gwadana kuce pa zaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">I zangacu Yesu kuro zaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Yesu busilacumega kacuta ka iogo i Betani, bware bu danda siwa si bware ni tanaga unu u burya̠ . <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Yesu ni tanaga unu u burya̠ , bware bu curega a zangaci bware danju u zaro. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />2 Kwa aba ni pan bware cilabe kwa aba ni maringya ni urshalima ni wa̱wo dinyiya. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Kwa aba ni madala ni suwa iginga, aba ni pangana Hwinsu cilabe.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>